{śivajñānasiddhi svapakṣa dṛṣṭānta saṅgrahaḥ} ||

abhīpsitārthasidhyarthaṃ pūjitoyassurairapi |
sarvavighnacchide tasmai gaṇādhipataye namaḥ ||

vande kundendudhavalaṃ dantabhinnāntarāyakam |
dānadhārāpatatbhṛṅga saṅgītaṃ kuñjarānanam ||

śrīmadabhra sabhāmadhye nityamānanda tāṇḍavam |
kurvāṇamumayā sārdhaṃ sevyamānaṃ śivaṃbhaje ||

kailāsadvāra pārśvasthaṃ brahmaviṣṇvādi vanditam |
śrīnandikeśaraṃ vande suyaśāvallabhaṃ prabhum ||

satyajñāninamācāryaṃ samyak bodhaprakāśakam |
tacchiṣya aruṇandyākhya akarochāśāstra mānamat ||

parapakṣāvabodhākhyaṃ śatatrayamakārayat |
upotghāte pañcavṛttaṃ pramāṇe tu caturddaśa ||

<p. 969>

ādye saptati vṛttāni dvitīye navatiśca ṣaṭ |
tṛtīyepi ca catvāri catvāriṃśaccaturthake ||

pañcame navakaṃ paścāttatsaṃkhyā ṣaṣṭhasūtrake |
saptame tu catuṣkonañcatvāriṃśattathāṣṭame ||

navame dvādaśa proktaṃ daśame ṣaṭprakīrtitam |
ekādaśe dvādaśaṃ ca dvādaśe saptakaṃ smṛtam ||

svapakṣantu tataḥ paścāt saptaviṃśachśata trayam |
evaṃ pakṣadvayopetaṃ saptaviṃśati ṣaṭchśataḥ ||

śrīmattillavane puṇye guhāmaṭhamupāsayan |
nigamajñāna nāmnā tu prakhyāto bhūnmahītale ||

tannāmadhāritaśśiṣyassaṃpradāya pravarttakaḥ |
itthaṃ vyavahitaṃ śāstraṃ mavalokya yathāmati ||

tatprāmāṇika sidhyarthaṃ mūlaśāstra prasiddhaye |
uddhṛtyāgama śāstrāṇi cākarochśāstramuttamam ||

svāyambhuve (-)

vacanenāpi tuṣṭi syāduttamasyādhikāriṇaḥ
dṛṣṭānte naiva tuṣṭi syānmadhyamasyādhikāriṇaḥ
yena kenāpi tuṣṭi syādadhamasyādhikāriṇaḥ |

ajite (-) 

lokāyatotha bauddhaṃ cāthārhaṃ mīmāṃsameva ca |
māyāvādaṃ pāñcarātraṃ ṣaḍete samayā bahiḥ 

bhīmasaṃhitāyām (-)

<p. 970>

goṣṭhivatsamayaṃ bheda kṣīravachśivamucyate |
śivaṃ sarvagataṃ śāntaṃ bhajennityaṃ śivāśrataḥ ||

ajite (-) 

ādimadhyānta nirmukta svabhāvavimalaḥ prabhuḥ |
sarvajñaḥ paripūrṇaśca śivo jñeyaśśivāgamaiḥ ||

cintyaviśve (-)

pūrvokta dīkṣayā yuktaṃ śiṣyaṃ vijñāna dīkṣayā |
dīkṣayet kṛpayā pūrṇo gurussanmārgadāyakaḥ ||

manovyāpāramātreṇa yā dīkṣā vidyate kramāt |
sā dīkṣā jñāna dīkṣā ca vijñānākhyā sa vai bhavet ||

(*****) pradeśe (**) vosthāne śirasthāne viśeṣataḥ |
śrī pādau śirasā dhṛtvā svātmajñāna (**) bodhayet ||

śivadharmmottare (-)

saṃskṛtaiḥ prākṛtairvākyairyaśśiṣyamanurūpataḥ |

(********************) |
(********************) ||

ye cānyāsakta hṛdayā yajantīśaṃ prasaṅgataḥ ||
teṣāmiṣṭandadātīśa sthānaṃ bhāvānurūpataḥ |

<p. 971>

tathā coktamācāryai (-)

ye cātra śuddha bhuvanodbhava bhogakāmā
stvāmarcayanti (********************) |
(********************) kebhyo
bhogandadāsi tadanantarameva mokṣam ||

ratnatraye | vāyavya saṃhitāyāṃ ca |

yato vāco nivartante na prāpyamanasā saha |
ānandaṃ yasya vaiśadyannabibheti kutaścana ||

skānde (-)

brahmācyutādibhirdevaiḥ vedairapi vitarkkitam |
cchando rūpaṃ śaṭhātmānaśśaktāstotuṃ katham prabhum ||

pauṣkare (-)

adhunā śrotumicchāmaḥ pramāṇāni kṛpānidhe |
uttaram || śruṇudhvamathamānāni śrotuṃ kautūhalaṃ yadi ||

siddhatantre (-)

tripadārtha pramāṇāya pramāṇāni daśocyate |
pratyakṣaṃ prathamaṃ proktandvitīyamanumānakam ||

tṛtīyaṃ śabdamityuktama bhāvantu caturthakam |
arthāpattiḥ pañcamantu samānaṃ ṣaṣṭhameva ca ||

<p. 972>

aitīhaṃ navamaṃ proktaṃ daśamantu svabhāvakam |
darśanepyanumāne ca śāstrentarbhūyate daśa ||

(cakā) siddhatantre (-)

vikalpa bhedasandehaṃ vinā jñeyaṃ sudarśanam |
vastuto vidyamānārthā vinābhāvākhya hetunā ||

anumānaṃ ca śāstrākhyamanumeyaṃ ca sādhayet |

suprabhede (-)

akṣādikaraṇairddṛśyaṃ pratyakṣantadihocyate |
liṅgena liṅgi vijñānamanumānamiti smṛtam ||

āptokti vacanairgamyaṃ śabdametadudāhṛtam |

pauṣkare (-)

dvyālambā saṃśayā buddhissamānākāra darśanāt |
viparyayonyathā jñānamatadrūpaṃ pratiṣṭhitam ||

akṣādi karaṇairdṛśyaṃ pratyakṣaṃ dvividhaṃ ca tat |
vastu svarūpamātrasya grahaṇannirvikalpakam ||

nāmajātyādi sambandhasahitaṃ savikalpakam |

tathā siddhatantre (-)

siddhārthānvayamanveti sandehaṃ pūrvamucyate |
sutarārthaṃ sa eveti bhedo vidyavasīyate ||

<p. 973>

nāma jāti guṇaṃkarmma cārthapañca vikalpate |
padārthābhāvabhūtaṃ ca nirvikalpaṃ sa maunavat ||

siddhatantre (-)

darśane tu caturyogaṃ manaścendriya vedanā |
anumānaṃ svayaṃ vedyamanya vedyamiti dvidhā ||

trikāraṇyāgamastantra kalāmantropadeśavat |

pauṣkare (-)

pratyakṣantrividhamuktam |
etaccendriya sāpekṣannirapekṣantathaiva ca ||

antaḥkaraṇa sāpekṣamiti trividhamiṣyate |
pratyakṣantrividhaṃ proktamakṣamānasacidvaśāt ||

iti kvacitpakṣaḥ | siddhatantre (-)

prakṛtirmadhyamā jñeyā kintu hi dvipramāṇataḥ |
anyasva jātyatītaṃ ca yattatprakṛtirucyate ||

pūrvaṃ caturvidhākhyasya darśanasya sa ucyate |
jñānendriya kalāpaṃ ca rūpāyaṃ cātma saṃyutam ||

vikalpādi vinājñeyo yadā cendriyadarśanam |
jñānākṣādi vināgamyamakṣādi viṣayādi ca ||

<p. 974>

malinaṃ rodhitaṃ jñānaṃ taddhimānasa darśanam ||

pauṣkare (-)

anyaccendriya sāpekṣaṃ syādācchāda nivṛttaye |
indriyā pekṣayā śaktyā tadvāreṇārtha vīkṣaṇam ||

antaḥkaraṇasāpekṣaṃ bāhendriya japena tu |
antaḥkaraṇasāpekṣañcicchakterdhyeya saṅgatiḥ ||

siddhatantre (-)

ātmajñānena jīvādyaissukhaduḥkhādi bhuñjate |
ādhyātmānmucyate hyetat vedanā darśanaṃ bhavet ||

samādhibhissamutsāryaṃ anyadeśa caritrakam |
eva vāsastatojñeyo yogibhissāmya darśanaḥ ||

siddhatantre (-)

trayaḥ pakṣa strihetuśca pratyekaṃ trividhaṃ bhavet |
tadidaṃ dvividhaṃ vakṣye praśastamanumānakam ||

svārthaṃ parārthamiti ca svapara jñānagantataḥ |
hetubhiḥ prativikhyātamanyakasya svavitbhavet ||

anvayi vyatirekīti hetuvākyamidandvidhā |

tathā pauṣkare (-)

anvaya vyatirekī ca kevala vyatireki ca |
<p. 975> kevalānvayarūpeṇa krameṇaparilakṣyate ||


siddhatantre (-)

svapakṣassamapakṣaśca parapakṣaśca jāyate |
svapakṣasya dṛśārthaṃ syāt samapakṣī puṭīdṛśā ||

svamatārthannayatyarthaṃ parapakṣassa ucyate |

tathā pauṣkare (-)

sādhyadharmmayutaḥ pakṣaḥ sapakṣastatsadharmmayuk |
tadvidharmmo vipakṣasyāt avasthāntara bhedavat ||

prathamaṃ heturityuktaṃ dvitīyaṃ kāryamīritam |
tṛtīyaṃ cānulabdhākhyamevaṃ prakaraṇantridhā ||

avasthāntara bhedatvamevaṃ prakaraṇaṃ viduḥ |
kāryadhūmaka gantṛtvamagnerddarśanamityapi ||

śītābhāvaṃ himābhāvaṃ tatjñeyamanulabdhakam |

pauṣkare (-)

sā ca vyāptirdvidhātredhā vyatirekyanvayātmikā |

siddhatantre |

dhūmāgnyorbhavataḥ pākagṛhesau kathyatenvayī |
patsavāpītale dhūmannāsīditara ucyate ||

pauṣkare (-)

tacceha pañcāvayavaṃ pratijñā hetureva ca |
dṛṣṭāntaścopanayanā nigamaśceti pañcamaḥ ||

<p. 976>

iṣṭārthoktiḥ pratijñā syāddhetustadvyāptimadvacaḥ |
dṛṣṭāntastūcitokti yāddheturyadvatparīkṣyate ||

dṛṣṭānta pakṣayorvyāpti prastāraṃ yadupānayaḥ |
punaḥ pratijñā niyamo nigamasyātsa hetukaḥ ||

siddhatantre (-)

punarapyanumānena trividhākhyeti cetkatham |
prāgdarśanānumānantaddvare gandhena puṣpavat ||

anumānānumānantu vāgajñānamanumānavat |

puṣkare (-)

āptoktirāgamārthopi parīkṣārthaika sādhanam |
pratyekṣeṇānumānena yāti cārthaṃ suniścitam ||

yo vetti soyamātmā syāttasmādāptassadāśivaḥ |
idamatra samākhyātaṃ prāguktantrividhāgamaḥ ||

anādiśuddha sarvajña śivena kathitāgamaḥ |
pūrvāparāvirodhaṃ yattaddhitantraṃ kalā bhavet ||

cittādi niścilaṃ kṛtvā tadvatkuryāccānukulam |
ādyantarahito devo bhāva bodhopadeśavit ||

pakṣābhāvastu catvāro hetvabhātvekaviṃśatiḥ |
siddhāntā bhātvadarśāṣṭau dvāviṃśannigrahā smṛtāḥ ||

<p. 977>

pañcaṣaṣṭirime proktā ābhāsa(?)

atha prathama dṛṣṭāntamucyate |
atra sūtralakṣaṇaṃ niśvāsa kārikāyā muktam |

tadyathā |

sūcanātsūtramityāhussūtranāma mahatpadam |
tena sarvamidaṃ protaṃ sūtre maṇigaṇā iva ||

tathoktam parāśarapurāṇe (-)

alpākṣaramasandigdhaṃ sāravadviśvatomukham |
astobhamanavadyaṃ yat sūtraṃ sūtravido viduḥ ||

svāyambhuve (-)

strī punnapuṃsakaṃ jñeyañjagatsarvaṃ krameṇajam |
sthitissaṃhārato vipra sarvadā kartṛ pūrvakam ||

anādi muktacidrūpaḥ kṛtyakartāharaḥ prabhuḥ |

tathā śivajñāna bodhe (-)

strīpunnapuṃsakāditvaṃ jagataḥ kāryadarśanāt |
astikarttā sahṛtvaitat sṛjatyasmātprabhurharaḥ ||

svāyambhuve (-)

kāṣā(?)nityā jagatsṛṣṭi sthitirdhvaṃsaka ucyate |

uttaram |

nānumānāgamāvatra cāsya kāryasya sambhave |
dṛṣṭivat sarvabhūteṣu nāśotpatti pradṛśyatām ||

<p. 978>

atha sarvamatopanyāse (-)

pratyakṣeṇa hi siddheddhainānumānaṃ pravartate |
anumānena sādhyaṃ cet paratatvaṃ prasajyate ||

svabhāva iti bhūtānāṃ sṛṣṭissaṃhāra ucyate |

uttaram | parākhye (-)

caturṇāmapi bhūtānāṃ svabhāvo naiva dṛśyate |
tasmānna kampate dhātrī kamuṣṇaṃ dṛśyate kavacit ||

vahninnirvāṇa māyāti vāyururdhva gatiḥ kvacit |
bhūteṣu hi svabhāṣena kiṃ punaḥ kāryasambhave ||

sṛṣṭisthityantanāśena kāryatvenāna yogataḥ |
jaḍatvenāpyatobhūte sarvataḥ karttṛ pūrvakam ||

parākhye (-)

svayameva caturbhūtaḥ sarvakṛtyaṃ karotyataḥ |
phalapradamtiti proktaṃ kvacitkartā ca mā kuru ||

uttaram ||

bhūtāścatuṣṭayāḥ khyātā sthityutpatti layāssadā |
ādyantarahito devassarvatopi karotyasau ||

śayaśca viśeṣeṇa būtānāmutbhavā (*****) |
bhūtādvinātra kārya (********************) |
(********************) cyate ||

<p. 979>

dvayośca kāraṇaṃ māyetyāhuratra vipaścitaḥ |
paṭādyā yajamānena kāryotpattirna dṛśyate ||

tathāsya syāt tu kārya (*****) |
(********************) rvato bhavet |

niśvāsottare (-)

svayameveti nāsti syānnāsti karttaika vastu cet |
tathaivā yāti tasya syānnāśotpattistataḥ katham ||

asti kartā tathā ca syāttayā tatkārya darśanāt |

niśvāsottare (-)

aha dehalayotpatti jaḍādṛṣṭaṃ kathaṃ bhavet |

uttaram |

śrotumicchami sarveṣāmitīdaṃ śṛṇu pārvati |
ākāśājjāyate vāyurvāyoragnirudāhṛtaḥ ||

agnejjalañjalātpṛthvī bhūtānāṃ kramameva hi |
eteṣāṃ sarvabhūtānāṃ saṃyogo loka ucyate ||

anyatra |

evaṃ kramāllayaḥ proktastacca kālāntareṇa tu |

kāraṇe cintye (-)

yadi sa tṛṇanāśopi na cecchuṇvasya pārvati |

<p. 980>

vārṣādivāṅkurandṛśyamabhavat svapathā jagat |

kāraṇe (-)

kālastribhiścetanaścet kartṛtvaṃ kāla eva hi |

uttaram |

upādānena jātena nāśenāpi jaḍo bhavet ||

api ca |

prapañcasṛṣṭirityuktaṃ ekakāle hi sambhavaḥ |
tasmānmaheśa eva syāt kālavatparipālakaḥ ||

kāraṇe (-)

akhilākhyamaṇūnāṃ ca karmmaṇāṃ sambhavāttataḥ |

uttaram |

yadvacca pūrvamevoktam karmmāpi jaḍavatbhavet |
ghaṭasyamṛdupādānandṛṣṭya yaddṛśyate tathā ||

idantadanumānena māyopādāna kāraṇam |
māyā kāraṇamevāhuraṇūnāṃ kāryadarśanāt ||

kāraṇe (-)

jagataḥ kāraṇākhyāṇu bhūtakāryeti kathyate |
kāryāvayava rūpeṇa dṛśyenāpi ghaṭādivat ||

yaddṛśyaṃ tadvināśyaṃ syānmāyopādāna kāraṇam |
sṛṣṭisthiti(?)saṃhāram māyā kāryaṃ vipaścitaḥ ||

kathaṃ cetbījaśākhādi bhūmādhāreṇa jātavāt |

ratnatraye (-)

yadyadutpadyate vastu tanmāyeyaṃ kathā kalā |
utpattināśo māyāyā dharmmāvāha maheśvaraḥ ||

<p. 981> kiraṇe (-)

tatkāryakārikā śaktiḥ kriyākhya sūkṣmarūpiṇī |
sthūlakāryaṃ ca sūkṣmāpi sthitānyagrodhabījavat ||

jagatkāraṇa māyākhya pariṇāmaḥ kadācana |
māyayātra jagajjātaśśaśaśṛṅgokti jātavat ||

vṛkṣācchado nāpūrveṇa paścād vṛkṣeṣu jāyate |
kūtataśca tathaivoktā sthiti syāt kāraṇaṃ punaḥ ||

kāraṇe (-)

iyaṃ kāraṇa kāryeṇa hyanādākhyaṃ jagatsadā |
atiprapañcantatkarttā sṛṣṭikāryāttato bhavet ||

praśnaḥ |

viśvakāraṇaṃ māyaiva kathaṃ kartteti nocyate |

parākhye (-)

atosti buddhimānkaścidīśvarassamava sthitaḥ |
ādi prapañcantatkarttā copādānaṃ paraṃ smṛtam ||

pratipanna svakāryeṇa dṛṣṭenātrānumānataḥ |
anyathānupapattyāvā tadvadevamanādikam ||

mūrttāssā vayavāyerthā nānārūpaparicchadāḥ |
patirviśvasya nirmmātā paśupāśa vilakṣaṇaḥ ||

abhāve tasya viśvasya sṛṣṭireṣā kathaṃ bhavet |
acetanatvādajñatvādanayoḥ paśupāśayoḥ ||

<p. 982>

pradhāna paramāṇvādi yāvakriṃcidacetanam |
na tatkartu svayandraṣṭuṃ buddhimatkāraṇaṃ vinā ||

jagatkattā sāpekṣaṃ kāryaṃ sāvayavaṃ yutaḥ |
tasmāt kāryasya kartṛtvaṃ patyurnna paśupāśayoḥ ||

parākhye (-)

nimittamīśvarākhyaṃ taddṛṣṭaṃ sahakāraṇam |
upādānaṃ ca yatsūkṣmaṃ sarvakāryeṣu saṃhitam ||

ya śaktiśceśvaro māyā mṛdvaccātra kulālavat |

tathā niśvāse (-)

yathā kārye ghaṭādyā tu kumbhakāreṇa mṛttikā |
kāryākhyaṃ ca jagatsarvaṃ kāraṇena karoti saḥ ||

kriyā śaktyā jagatsarvaṃ kurute parameśvaraḥ |
kāraṇānāntrayantena sarvakāryenumīyate ||

niśvāsottare (-)

bindumāye tayāvyaktaḥ kāraṇatrayamucyate |
tasyāścatasro vāgrūpā vṛttayo vaikharīmukhāḥ ||

vaikharī madhyamācānyā paśyantī sūkṣmasaṃjñitā |

pauṣkare (-)

kalāvidyā ca rāgaśca kāloniyatireva ca |
pañcaitāni ca tatvāni māye yāni dvijottamāḥ ||

<p. 983> mṛgendre (-)

guṇadhīgarvacittākṣa mātrābhūtānyanukramāt |

pauṣkare (-)

kartṛtvaṃ dvividhaṃ viprāḥ kriyāssaṅkalpakoṭayaḥ |
aṣṭāvananta pūrvāste yathā pūrvaṃ guṇādhikāḥ ||

pare sadāśiva samāḥ patikṛtyānukāriṇaḥ |
tattvādhvā bhuvanādhvā ca varṇādhvā ca padakramaḥ ||

mantrādhvā vyāpakasteṣāṃ kalādhvā bindumāśritaḥ |
bindupādāna janyatvātteṣāṃ baindavamucyate ||

pauṣkare (-)

catasro vṛttayastasyāḥ vābhirvyāptāstridhāṇavaḥ |
ābhyo na paramo bandha ābhyo muktistu nāparā ||

tannivṛtya vinā bhūto dṛkkriyāvārako yataḥ |

tathā niśvāsottare (-)

āhureva jagatsarvaṃ pravṛddhaṃ śabdavṛttibhiḥ |
na hi śabdādṛte puṃsaḥ pratyayosti kadācana ||

yadāśiva prasādena jñānaṃ syānmokṣa asya tu |

kālottare

āgopālāṅganā bālā mlecchāḥ prākṛta bhāṣiṇaḥ |
<p. 984> antarjalaṃ gatāssatvāstepi nityaṃ vruvantitam ||

asyārthaḥ | tasya vṛttau prapañcitaḥ | ratnatraye (-)

pariṇāmasya kartṛtvenajñā(?) vai vṛttayastathā |
pariṇāmastatonantaḥ yataḥ karttā tatastathā ||

niśvāsottare (-)

rūporūpena jātopi vikāropyavikāravat |
avikāre arūpe khe bhūtānāñjananādivat ||

vidyuddhūma dhanustoyamevā śanijaśabdavat |

niśvāse (-)

yathā loke ghaṭādyāstu kumbhakārāmmṛdā tathā |
kāryākhyantu jagatsarvaṃ kartṛtvena karoti saḥ ||

praśnaḥ |

akhaṇḍa paripūrṇāsāvadhi tiṣṭhankaroti saḥ |
kālastaruṣvamūrtopi karoti kuṃsumoccayam ||

phalānāṃ ca tathā teṣāṃ patanañca yathā niśam |
tathotpatti vināśānāṃ karttā śambhuramūrttimān ||

tathā kiraṇe (-)

yathā kālohyamūrtopi dṛśyate phalasādhakaḥ |
evaṃ śivohyamūrtopi kurute kāryamicchayā ||

<p. 985>

niśvāsottare (-)

sarvātmanāṃ ca jananaṃ maraṇaṃ ca tathaiva hi |
kāruṇyāt kleśamālokya teṣāṃ śambhuḥ punastathā ||

karmmaṇāṃ pācanārthāya sṛṣṭinnirmmāya pūrvavat |

mṛgendre (-)

svavyāpārān bodhayan bodhayogyān
rodhyānundhan pācayankarmmikarmma |
māyāśaktiṃ vyaktiyogyāṃ prakurvan
paśyansarvaṃ yadyathā vastujātam ||

niśvāsottare (-)

śivaḥ kṛtyatrayaṃ caiva kurutepyadhikāravān |
śilāgāregni pakvaṃ ca patmabhūmau rasakṣayam ||

ādityena yathā dṛśyamīśvareṇa tathaiva ca |
rudro viṣṇustathā brahmasṛṣṭi sthityanta devatāḥ ||

ādau kṛtyāstimānproktaśśiva eveti tachśruṇu |
brahmā sampūjyaṃ bhaktyā taṃ liṅgaṃ śaivamayaṃ śubham ||

tasya sampūjanādeva prāptatvaṃ brahmatvamuttamam |
indranīlamayaṃ liṅgaṃ samabhyarcya janārddanaḥ ||

viṣṇutvaṃ prāptavāṃstena sotbhūtaika sanātanam |

<p. 986>

brahmādistamba paryantañjagadyoniścarācaram |
carācarādibhūtānāṃ prāṇa bhūtaśśiva smṛtaḥ ||

tathā vāyavye

paramaiśvarya sampannāḥ parameśvara bhāvitāḥ |
tacchaktyādhiṣṭhitā nityaṃ tatkāryakaraṇakṣamāḥ ||

svāyambhuve (-)

saṃsṛjya viśvaṃ bhuvanaṃ goptāsan sañjahāra yaḥ |
eka eva tadā rudro na dvitīyosti kaścana ||

atītā khalvasaṃkhyātā brahmāṇo harayo yataḥ |

skānde (-)

saṃsāraduḥkhaharaṇāt prapañcaharaṇāccayā |
prāktanairhara ityākhyā bhavataḥ parikīrtitā ||

prakṛtau pralaye prāpte naṣṭe sthāvara jaṅgame |
brahmā viṣṇussurāssarve layaṃ yānti śivaṃ vinā ||

svāyaṃbhuve (-)

paśunā dehasaṃyogo bhogomokṣāya kathyate |
tathāpi santaścetyāhuranādimalamocakāḥ ||

paśūnāṃ hārimityuktam vismayaṃ gamayet pado |
malabaddhena sraṣṭākhyā tattatkarmmamalaṃ gatam ||

<p. 987>

sthitirjananamantoyaṃ karmmayogetvahaṃkṛtiḥ |
vivakṣayā paśūnāntu vidyamānamanugrahaḥ ||

tathānyatrājagatsā (********************) |
(********************) teṣu kaḥ kartṛrūpakaḥ ||

uttaram ||

evametattrayaṃ coktantasya rūpamudāhṛtam |

tathā suprabhede (-)

tachśarīraṃ tridhājñeyaṃ niṣkalaṃ (**) ṣkalam |
(********************) ||

(********************) |
(*****) yogināṃ śaktiḥ grahaṇe mokṣaṇepi ca ||

tadvadeva hi boddhavyaṃ grahaṇaṃ mocanaṃ vibhoḥ |
māyātmaka (*****) ttamam ||

mṛgendre (-)

mūlādyā śāmbhavācchādyavapurnnastādṛśaṃ vibhoḥ |
tasyaiva pāśamuktatvāt jñānaṃ kena nivāryate ||

mataṅge (-)

atha śakti svarūpaścet pariṇāmohi dṛśyate |
nityānandasya rūpaṃ ca ṣaḍadhvā mārgavatbhavaḥ ||

<p. 988> ḍaṃ(?)kiṇipatā |

viśve sarvapadārthepi rūpārūpanna yogajam |
saśivopi ca pathyeṣu tathāpyeko bhavetpunaḥ ||

bandhamokṣapadārtho na nādyanto nāpi saṃścasaḥ |
na lakṣyate tayā tasya kvacitbhāva viniścitaḥ ||

cintye (-)

nirāmayo nirādhāro varṇarūpavivarjitaḥ |
sarvajñassarvagaśśāntassarvātmā sarvato mukhaḥ ||

yassākṣī sukhaduḥkhānāṃ lokesminsarva vastuni |
sa eva bhagavānvyāpī cāprameyopyanaupamaḥ ||

pauṣkare (-)

svasvecchā mātratastasya svaśakti kiraṇātmikaḥ |
mūrtimāsādyate yasmāt sadyomūrtiriti smṛtaḥ ||

vātulottare (-)

rūpamādāya kṛpayā kathyate cāgamārṇavān |
tathopapannā sarvasya gurusantānapādukā ||

tathā kiraṇe (-)

evanna kurute tāvadyāvanno gurusantatiḥ |
kurutenugrahandevassarveṣāmeva dehinām ||

<p. 989>

kintūpadeśa kartṛtvāt sa gurustena saśśivaḥ |
yadyasau sakale naiva nāmamantragurukramaḥ ||

kintūpadeśena vinā tadā bhavati niṣphalaḥ |
yadyevanna bhavet tatthyaṃ tadā na syāt gurukramaḥ ||

puṃsāmanugrahārthāya paropyaratāṃ gataḥ |
kṛtvā mantrātmakandehaṃ valki(?) tantrāṇyanekadhā ||

bodhyabodhaka sambandhādvakti tantrāṇyanekadhā |

vātulottare (-)

yadrūpaṃ tatkṛpā tasya śiva sṛṣṭyādikantathā |
sāṅgopāṅga itīśasya bhogadaṃ mokṣadaṃ prabhoḥ ||

taduktaṃ kāraṇe (-)

netra nāsāgra karṇośca pāṇīpādatalāṅgulīḥ |
jaṭāmakuṭa samyuktaṃ sāṅgaṃ ceti prakīrtitam ||

vastropavīta mālyāni cāyudhābharaṇāni ca |
gaṅgācandra apasmāranāgrakūrmmantataḥ punaḥ ||

āsanādīni sarvāṇi copāṅgamiti kīrtitam |

vātulaśuddhākhyāyām (-)

aṅgapratyaṅgasāṅgāni caturthopāṅgamityapi |

<p. 990>

suprabhede (-)

rudraikādaśa pūrvastu dvādaśāditya saṃyutāḥ |
vasavaścāśvinīyuktāstraya striṃśati devatāḥ ||

skānde (-)

brahmādi devatāścānyā naiva saṃsāramocakāḥ |
eṣāmeva hi jantūnāṃ mahāsaṃsāra varttinām ||

saṃhāramokṣakasteṣāṃ sarvajñassāmba īśvaraḥ |

śuddhākhyāyām (-)

nānārūpadharo devo nānābhoga samanvitaḥ |
nānācihna samopeto nānālīlādharoharaḥ ||

maheśaṃ sakalaṃ vidyāt sṛṣṭisthitilayātmakam |

tathā vāyavye (-)

caritāni vicitrāṇi guhyāni gahanāni ca |
durvijñeyāni devasya mohayanti manāṃsi ca ||

vīratantre (-)

somāskandastu pūrvasyāt sukhāsīnastataḥ param |
kalyāṇasundaraścaiva candraśekhara eva ca ||

gaṅgādharaśca pañcaite sṛṣṭirūpā udāhṛtāḥ |
vṛṣavāhordhanārīśaḥ kirāto vīra eva ca ||

<p. 991>

bhikṣāṭana parāścaite sthiti mūrttaya īritāḥ |
nartako madanāriśca kāladantipuradviṣaḥ ||

jalandharaghnaścaite ṣaṭ bhedāssaṃhāramūrtayaḥ |

śaive ekādaśa rudrasaṃhitāyām

kadācidrahasi prītānijājñāvaśavarttinaḥ |
ramaṇañjānatī mugdhā paścādabhyetya sādaram ||

karābhyāṃ kamalābhābhyāṃ netramasya jagatpateḥ |
pidadhe līlayāśambhoḥ kiṃ bhavediti kautukāt ||

andhakāro bhavettīvraṃ cirakālabhayaṅkaram |
nimeṣārdhena devasya jagmurvatsara koṭayaḥ ||

devī bilādutthena tamasā bhūjjagatkṣayaḥ |
tamasā pūritaṃ viśvaṃmapareṇa samantataḥ ||

ruddhāste sūrayo bhaktāśśambhumānamya tuṣṭuvuḥ |
iti teṣāṃ vacaśrutvā bhaktānānniyatātmanām ||

vikāsite tu phālākṣe jagrāha viśvarantamaḥ |
viśvasākṣīti gaurīyaṃ karuṇāmūrttirandhravit ||

visasarja ca sā devī pidhānaṃ hara cakṣuṣoḥ |
somasūryāgni rūpāṇāṃ prakāśairabhavajjagat ||

<p. 992>

laiṅge (-)

gatvā tadāśramaṃ śambhostadāratyā tayā saha |
vasantena sahāyena devaṃ yoddhuṃ manohyabhūt ||

tatassaṃprekṣya madanaṃ hasanneva striyambakaḥ |
nayanena tṛtīyena sāvajñantamavaikṣata ||

tatosya netrajo vahnirmadanaṃ pārśvata sthitam |
adrahat tatkṣaṇādeva līlāvān karuṇānidhiḥ ||

sthitaye hyāśramāṇāṃ ca hitārthaṃ bhagavānbhavaḥ |
tadā haimavatīndevīmupayeme yathā vidhi ||

cintye (-)

nisargasthiti saṃhāraṃ yasminneva nigadyate |

tathā kāmike (-)

devadānava gandharvamunayo manujādayaḥ |
pipīlikā gajādyantā jaṅgamāsthāvarāścaye ||

tenugrāhyā smṛtāśāstrenugrāhyā bahudhā matāḥ |

vātulaśuddhākhyāyām (-)

sṛṣṭyarthaṃ sarvatatvānāṃ lokasyotpattikāraṇam |
yogināmupakārāya gṛhṇāti svecchayātanum ||

śivassadāśivaścaiva maheśastrividha smṛtaḥ |
śivastattva mahāsena niṣkalantvitikīrtitam ||

<p. 993>

sakalanniṣkalopetaṃ sādākhyamiti cocyate |
maheśassakalaṃ vidyātttrividhāste bhavanti vai ||

suprabhede (-)

niṣkalaṃ ca kalāhīnaṃ kalābhissakalaṃ bhavet |
sakalākalamiśraṃ yattasmāttasmāt sakalaniṣkalaḥ ||

paranniṣkalamityuktamaparaṃ sakalaṃ smṛtaḥ |
parāparantu yatproktantatsyātsakalaniṣkalam ||

vātulottare (-)

adhvamūrtiriti khyātiḥ parametat kathaṃ prabho |

uttaram ||

nityenāpi ca pūrveṇa cidacicceṣṭitena ca ||

vedāgameṣu śāstreṣu cādhvāmūrtirihocyate |

taduktaṃ brahmaśambhupādaiḥ (-)

śāntyatīta kalāmūrdhāṃ śāntirvaktra saroruhaḥ |
vidyākalā tu vakṣoṅgaṃ pratiṣṭhā guhyamaṇḍalam ||

nivṛttirjjānu jaṅghāṅghri bhuvanādhvā tanūruhāḥ |
varṇatvaṅmantra rudhiraṃ padaṃ māṃsa sirādikam ||

tattvaṃ majjāsthi śuklādi dhātavaḥ parameṣṭhinaḥ |
sadāśivaṣṣaḍadhvātmā tasya prāṇaśśiva smṛtaḥ ||

tathā svāyambhuve (-)

<p. 994>

tattvaṃ padaṃ ca mantraṃ ca varṇaṃ ca bhuvanaṃ kalā |
adhvāmārgassamākhyāto vyāpakatvaṃ śivasya tu ||

ayādhvā kalpyate tathyaṃ vyāpakatvaṃ tathā gatam |

vātulottare (-)

kiṃ kāraṇena mantrādhvā devasya tanurucyate |
upādānamataśśaktirbindubhirmmohitañjagat ||

cintayārahitaṃ yattatparamaṃ paramaṃ parikīrtitam |
mantrayonirmmahāmāyā yā parigraha varttinī ||

kālottare (-)

tasminprajāyate mantrastatraiva pravilīyate |

vātulottare (-)

śivaśśaktyādhiṣṭhitastu mantrādhvā tena kīrtitaḥ |
bhuktimukti pradāmantrāstvarccitā śivamadhvaraiḥ ||

anugrahāya lokasya śivomantra iti smṛtaḥ |
yātvanugrāhikā śaktissāmarasyamihāgatā ||

mantreṣu pañcamantrastha yuktantantreṣu vakṣyate |

uttaram |

ātmanonugrahārthāya svecchayā sa ca kathyate ||

pañcamantratanu śrīmān sakalaḥ paripaṭhyate |
mataṅge īśānaṃ prathamaṃ brahma tatastatpuruṣātmakam ||

<p. 995>

tṛtīyamapyaghorākhyaṃ vāmadevātmakantataḥ ||

pañcamaṃ sadya ityuktam brahma sarvārthasādhakam |
prādhānyena sthitā hyetā vidyāmantrāśca suvrata ||

īśānī pūraṇīhārdi vāmāmūrttiśca pañcadhā |
etābhissamavetosau śaktibhissamamadhiṣṭhitaḥ ||

tathā pauṣkare (-)

evaṃ mantrāstu pañcaite tairnibaddhā tanu (*****) |
(********************)rtha śaṅkitaḥ ||

vāyavye (-)

brahmādayopi lokānāṃ sṛṣṭi sthityanta hetavaḥ |
brahmāviṣṇustato rudrassṛṣṭisthityanta devatāḥ ||

ādau kṛtyāptimān proktaśśiva eveti tatsmṛtam |
svā (********************) ||

(********************) moghābalaśālinī |
ekāneka vibhāgena sa (********************) śivecchayā ||

kriyā tridhātu vijñeyā vāmājyeṣṭhā ca raudrikā |

tathā niśvāsottare (-)

mantryādyaneka jantūnāṃ bhūpateśśaktibhedavat |
eka eva śivaśśaktistathā kāryāhya bhedataḥ ||

<p. 996>

tasmāchśivātmikā śaktirbhogamokṣau śivecchayā |

cintye

śaktirūpaṃ ca kovetti mahāvijñānameva hi |
kriyayā icchayā jñānairvinā tachśruṇu pārvati ||

yāvatjñānaṃ kriyāyecchā tasmātjñānaṃ kriyāṃ vinā |

svāyambhuve (-)

yadekekokta guṇaṃ śakti dharmmasāmarthyakandvidhā |
jñānaśaktiḥ kriyāśaktiricchā jñānakriyātridhā ||

śivena sarpajantūnāṃ kāruṇyātsamudāhṛtam |
jñānaśaktyā vijānāti kriyayā kurute jagat ||

parākhye (-)

cidrūpamātmano rūpandṛkkriyā guṇalakṣaṇam |
jñānarūpa sthitasyāpi svarūpandṛkkriyātmakam ||

uttaram (-)

kartṛśaktiraṇornnityā vahnīceśvara śaktivat |
tamacchannatayārtheṣu nābhāti niranugrahā ||

tathā mṛgendre (-)

caitanyandṛkkriyārūpantadastyātmani sarvadā |
sarvataśca yatomuktau śrūyate sarvato mukham ||

<p. 997>

tadapya bhāvamānatvāt tanniruddhaṃ pratīyate |

pauṣkare (-)

kevalaṃ jñānamevāpi śivameveti susthitam |

tatraiva |

upasaṃhṛta kāryātmā yadā bindurvyavasthitaḥ ||

tadālayāhvayantatvaṃ śivatatvaṃ tadeva hi |

cintyaviśve (-)

cidacit grāhakārthoyaśśivo mokṣastuśaktitaḥ |
asyaiva cāvibhāgeyam sā jvāleva havirbhujaḥ ||

jñānaśaktyā kriyāśaktyā samastantadvijṛmbhitam |
sadā śivākhyakantatvaṃ sakalanniṣkalaṃ bhavet ||

kriyā śaktyut baṇatvaṃ ca jñānaśaktya pakarṣaṇam |
tatra tatprasarantatvamīśvarākhyamidaṃ bhavet ||

kriyāśaktyapakarṣeṇa jñānaśaktyutvaṇantathā |
vidyā tatvasya cotpattirjñānagamyābhavattadā ||

icchājñānakriyā caiva śive sthitvā sadaiva hi |
svaṃ svaṃ kāryaṃ prakurvanti sarvānugrahakāraṇāt ||

kiraṇe (-)

icchānugraha kartṛtvāllaya bhogādhikāravān |
trividhaṃ kṛtya bhedena darśino nāma bhedata(?) ||

<p. 998>

mṛgendre (-)

śaktodyukta pravṛttatvāt karttā trividha iṣyate |
śakteḥ pravṛtti bhedena bhedastasyopacārataḥ ||

kālottare (-)

śivaśśaktiśca sādākhyamīśvarastadanantaram |
śuddhavidyā ca pañcaite śuddhatattvam prakīrtitam ||

mataṅge

śuddhadehamiti proktannityaṃ svātantryavigraham |
kṛtyabhedaṃ vinā pūrvāparannaprasarakramaḥ ||

kālottarepi tathā |

śivaiko bahurūpastu nabhaso bahurūpavat |
sarveṣāmapi bhāvopi yadarthena svabhāvataḥ ||

śivaśśaktiśceti vākyaṃ vṛkṣasya kaṭhinatvavat |

anyatra |

svarṇanīlādi saṃsparśāt sphaṭikantanmayaṃ yathā |
śivopi śaktibhirbhedyastayo svābhāvikañca tat ||

śivastu śaktibhedena tatsvabhāvannamuñcati |

mataṅge (-)

pravṛttau śaktayassiddhāśśaktīnāṃ kāraṇaṃ śivaḥ |
akāraṇaśśivaḥ proktastantresmin pārameśvare ||

<p. 999>

striyaḥ pumāniti jagat sarvaṃ śakti śivātmakam |
sarvasyānugrahārthaṃ ca liṅgapīṭhakramantathā ||

tathā vāyavye (-)

śaṅkaraḥ puruṣāssarve striyassarvā maheśvarī |
sarve strīpuruṣāstasmāttayoreva ca bhūtayaḥ ||

suprabhede (-)

liṅgenalāñchitaṃ puṃstvaṃ strītvaṃ vai yonilāñcchitam |
liṅgamīśamayaṃ proktaṃ yoniśśaktimayaṃ bhavet ||

tasmādve śivaśaktī tu sarvametaccarācaram |
liṅge śambhussamutbhūto nāmnā sopi sadāśivaḥ ||

pīṭhe śaktissamutbhūtā nāmnā sāpi manonmanī |

makuṭe (-)

liṅge ca pīṭhikāyāṃ ca śivaśaktisamudbhavaḥ |

mataṅge (-)

rūpannāstyasya nāmādi nāsti kṛtyaṃ karoti ca |
tathādi yogo bhogo na cidacinnāstyataśśivam ||

sarveṣāṃ svayamevasyāttanmayo nāsti yadyapi |
ityādima sūtraṃ purṇam ||

<p. 1000>

sarvajñābodhe (-)

anyassanvyāptitonanyaḥ karttākarmmānusārataḥ |
karoti saṃsṝtiṃ puṃsāṃ ājñayā samavetayā ||

cintye (-)

yasya sannidhimātreṇa ceṣṭante sarvajantavaḥ |
yasya satbhāva mucyante traiyyante sakalāgamāḥ ||

yatsa(?)mākṣī sukhaduḥkhānāṃ lokesmin sarvavastuni |
aṇoraṇurmmahīyāṃśca mahato yatparāparam ||

vedānteṣveka eveti kathaṃ bahutayocyate |

uttaram ||

teṣu karttaika eveti sādhyate paramārthataḥ |

vātulottare (-)

śivastu sarvajantūnāmakṣarāṇāmakāravat |

tathā śuddhākhye (-)

kalā jīva iti khyāto vikalā deha ucyate |

tathā kiraṇe (-)

carācarādi jantūnāṃ śivosau prāṇamucyate |

<p. 1001>

taṃ vinā prasatyeva nākṣarāṇāmakāravat |

tathā śuddhākhye (-)

kalājīva iti khyāto vikalādeha ucyate |
kalā ca vikalā caiva dehi dehāviti smṛtau ||

kalāhīnaṃ tu yadvarṇaṃ jīvahīnaṃ vinirddiśet |
vibhuśca tattvairātmā ca pratyekaṃ gaṇayet sthitim ||

parākhye (-)

karmmaṇā dehasaṃyogo vibhorapi maheśvarāt |
aśaktatvāt smṛto nāsya sāmarthyaṃ karmmayojane ||

siddhānta saṅgrahe

na kalpyau sukhaduḥkhābhyāṃ dharmmā dharmmau parairiha |
svabhāvena sukhī duḥkhī janonyonyaṃ na kāraṇam ||

parākhye (-)

jaleyaduṣṇa gandhatvaṃ kārmmikaṃ kṛtyatāvaśāt |
dehināṃ puṇyapāpākhyaṃ svabhāvena śubhāśubham ||

taccaitanyaṃ svabhāvaṃ hi tatsvabhāva viparyayaḥ |
ekasyārabhyate duḥkhaṃ sukhānāṃ vāpi tajjaḍam ||

ihaloke yadātmānam bahvarthosti sadā sukham |
nāsti duḥkhādṛte pūrvakṛtenaitattathā yadi ||

<p. 1002>

kṛtyannakṛtyatopyatra svayamevārtha sambhavaḥ |
sotsāhenāpi gṛhyorthastaskareṇāpi gṛhyate ||

kramādidaṃ kṛtaṃ kṛtyaṃ sukhaduḥkhādi bhuñjate |
tasmāt pūrvakṛte naiva sarvadā sarvataḥ paśoḥ ||

janmakṣayaṃ sukhaṃ kleśaṃ sukhaduḥkhādi bhuñjate |

tvārthakaṃ karmmamāraṇe (-)

etāni svasvakarmmāṇi svādhikāro nivarttate |
puruṣe ṣoḍaśakale tamāhuramṛtāhvayam ||

iti ca |

evamuktantu ṣaṭkarma garbhasākalya niścayam |
evaṃ pūrvakṛtaṃ karmma bhogatotra tu gacchati ||

tathā suprabhede (-)

maraṇādīni karmmāṇi nirmmitānīśvareṇa tu |
āyuṣyaṃ vibhavaṃ karmma vidyā ca nidhanaṃ sukham ||

ṣaṭkaṃ saṃpāpya tatraiva tato garbhāśayaṃ vrajet |

cintye (-)

dehe naiva kṛtaṃ karmma dehe naiva gatantathā ||

tatraiva |

deho hi etaccāṇūnāṃ kṣayenātma kalevaram |
prārabdhakarmmaṇā caiva punaḥ prārabhyate tanuḥ ||

<p. 1003>

