<p. 1014>

gautamaṃ sandadarśātha praviśantaṃ mahāmunim |
gṛhīta samidhantatra sakuśaṃ munipuṅgavam ||

atha dṛṣṭvā sahasrākṣaṃ muniveṣadharaṃ muniḥ |
mamarūpaṃ samāsthāya kṛtavānasi durmmate ||

akartavyamidaṃ yasmādviphalastvamidaṃ bhaviṣyasi |
gautame naiva muktastu saroṣeṇa mahātmanā ||

iha varṣasahasrāṇi bahūnitvannivatsyasi |
vāyu bhakṣānirāhārā tapyantyaśmaśarīriṇī ||

