<p. 1035>

caitanyadyotikā māyā caitat protsārite male |
ananyokta malomātmātvatha dehādi sambhave ||

bodhakāryaṃ rodhayitumāṇavākhyaṃ malohyalam |
ātmanā saṅganiṣṭhena guṇañca khyātimetat ||

kālādyākhyā pare tatve śukyādau rajato yathā |
tasmādiyaṃ malomāyā sadā dīpāndhakāravat ||

dvayo svabhāva bhedaśca tvayā khyātamidaṃ mune |
puruṣasya guṇo vidyāvadyatastacca so bhavet ||

uttaram |

tatkathaṃ tvaditi praśnandṛṣṭidoṣa guṇannahi |
tasmiṃstasmiṃstu tiṣṭhena tatpuruṣa svabhāva ca ||

evaṃ saurasaṃhitāyāṃ śaṅkāpurassaraṃ vistareṇa pratipāditantatrāvadhāryatām || svāyambhuve (-)

