sthāvarā vividhākārāstṛṇa gulmādibhedataḥ |
tatrānubhūya duḥkhāni jāyante kīṭayoniṣu ||

niṣkrāntāḥ kīṭayonibhyaḥ kramājjāyanti pakṣiṇaḥ |
visṛṣṭā pakṣibhāvena bhavanti mṛgajātiṣu ||

mṛgaduḥkhamatikramya jāyante paśuyoniṣu |
kramādgo yoni māsādya punarjāyantamānuṣe ||

evaṃ yoniṣu sarvāsu parikramakrameṇa tu |
devāsurāṇāṃ sarveṣāṃ mānuṣyamatidurllabham ||

vyutkrameṇāpi mānuṣyaṃ prāpyate puṇya gauravāt |

suprabhede (-)

tato bhāratavarṣaṃ ca navabhāge prakalpitaḥ |
kumārī dvīpādanyāstu klecchadvipāḥ prakīrttiāḥ ||

cāturvarṇasamāyuktañcaturāśrama samyutam |

śivadharmmottare (-)

deśesmin bhārate puṇye prāpyamānuṣyamadhruvam |
sarveṣāmeva deśānāmayandeśaḥ para smṛtaḥ ||

iti svargaṃ ca mokṣaṃ ca yatassaṃprāpyate janaiḥ |

<p. 1038>

cintya viśve (-)

śaivaṃ parapadaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvatatvaika nāyakam |
sarvamantramayaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvadevamayaṃ bhavet ||

janmāntara tapobhiśca sanmārga jñāna sambhavaḥ |

śivadharmmottare (-)

sarvasya mūlaṃ mānuṣyaṃ tadyatnādanupālayet |
dharmmasya mūlaṃ mānuṣyaṃ labdhvā sarvārthasādhanam ||

yadi lābhaikayatnāste mūlaṃ rakṣantu yatnataḥ |
devāsurāṇāṃ sarveṣāṃ mānuṣyamati durllabham ||

vyutkrameṇāpi mānuṣyaṃ labhate puṇyagauravāt |
tatsaṃprāpya tahā kuryānnagacchennarakaṃ yathā ||

mṛgendre hetumāha |

sarvāsāṃ phalabhūmīnāṃ karmmabhūḥ kāraṇaṃ yataḥ |
karmmabhūmiriyaṃ brahman phalabhūmirataḥ parā ||

iha yatkriyate karmma tatparatropabhujyate |

tathā śivadharmmottare (-)

bhogabhūmi smṛtasvargaḥ karmmabhūmiriyaṃ smṛtā |
iha yatkriyate karmma svarge tadupa bhujyate ||

vāyavya saṃhitāyām (-)

<p. 1039>

jātenātmadruhāyena nārccito bhagavāñcchivaḥ |
suciraṃ sañcaratyasmin saṃsāra duḥkhasāgare ||

śivadharmmottare (-)

janāśśatāyuṣaḥ kiṃ ca bhavanti na bhavanti vā |
aśītikāpi vidyante kecit saptatikā api ||

paramāyustu pañcāśattadapyasya na niścitam |
yasya yāvadbhavedāyurddehinaḥ pūrvakarmmataḥ ||

yāvat svasthaśarīrasthastāvaddharmaṃ samācaret |

tathā mohaśūrottare (-)

padmapatre yathā toyaṃ  (*****) sucañcalam |
tadvatsusañcalaṃ śakra prāṇināmihajīvanam ||

pauṣkare (-)

krameṇārthasya saṃvittiḥ puryātmālocanātmikā |
yathā hyaneka saṃvittau yugapatsā na vidyate ||

mukharitā (*****) parāparijan (*****) |
(**) vatti na vīkṣate dhanavacchibikāgataḥ |
jīvanena mṛtāḥ pañca purāvyāsena kīrtitāḥ ||

daridro vyādhito lubdhaḥ pravāsī nityasevakaḥ |

<p. 1040>

cintye (-)

liṅgasya darśanaṃ vātha liṅgārādhanameva vā |
vidyate yadijantūnāṃ bhavanti tridaśādhipāḥ ||

[iti dvitīyasūtraṃ sampūrṇam] ||



[tṛtīyasūtram ]||

parākhye (-)

dehānyo naśvarovyādhī vibhinnassamalojaḍaḥ |
svakarmma kalabhukkarttā kiṃcijñasseśvaraḥ paśuḥ ||

mṛgendre (-)

caitanyaṃ dṛkkriyārūpaṃ tadastyātmani sarvadā |

śivajñānabodhe (-)

avasthā pañcakantasya malaruddhasva dṛkkriyā |

tathā parākhye (-)

pañcāvasthaḥ pumānjñeyassuptau ca malagauravāt |
tādṛśātmānṛtaṃ paśyet turyātītamudāhṛtam ||

atra dehānya ātmeti dṛḍhatvaṃ kathyate kathyate katham |
dehādṛtena dṛśyante tasmādātmā na dehavit ||

<p. 1041>

uttaram (-)

tathā cettatraśītoṣṇaṃ bhujyate naiva dehavit |

mukurādisamāyuktamekāruṇamivoddhṛtam |
bhūtāścatuṣṭayaṃ yuktaṃ vidavāyu na vidyagam ||

uttaram (-)

suptatvamuktaṃ śavavat vāyusthiti na vaidyakim |
suptasyāvayava sparśāt smṛtirnaiva ca vidyate ||

tathā mṛgendre (-)

sopyeva sati sādvāna na satyapiśave citiḥ |

parākhye (-)

indriyaissahavitsopi yadi cenna ca rājavat ||

yatra yogāṅgatā senātadvāptaṃ kurute gatam |
ato devā vināyuktaṃ viyate hi na vidyate ||

[tṛtīyasūtraṃ sampūrṇam] ||


[caturthaṃ sūtram] ||

śivajñānabodhe (-)

ātmāntaḥ karaṇādanyopyanvito mantribhūpavat |

<p. 1042>

kāmike (-)

śarīrāt bāhya tasya pravṛttirūpalambhanāt |
ata eva mano nātmā na buddhirnāpyahaṃkṛtiḥ ||

parākhye (-)

antaḥkaraṇamuktaṃ cedanyonyantena vidyate |
khaśyāmādirasajñādi vaiṣamyaṃ syātsahendriyaiḥ ||

sarveṣāṃ dṛṣṭibhinnatvādahamityahamāsthitiḥ |

cintye (-)

citte kāryaṃ susaṃsmṛtvā buddhispaṣṭaṃ vicārya ca |
ahaṃ kāreṇa niścitya vaikalpyaṃ kurute manaḥ ||

evaṃ jñātvā yatotsāho svātmajñānaṃ samabhyaset |
akāraścāpyukāraśca makāro bindunādakau ||

yogena praṇavaṃ jñeyaṃ pañcadevātmakaṃ param |

kālottare (-)

akāraścopyukāraścāhaṃkāraṃ buddhireva ca |
makārastu manaścittaṃ bindunādātmavigraham ||

evaṃ pañca prakāreṇa coṅkāroddhṛtirucyate |

anyatra |

svarge deśātma bodhaśca samudre ca taraṅgavat ||

<p. 1043>

akāraṃ brahmadaivatyaṃ ukāraṃ viṣṇudaivatam |
makāraṃ rudradaivatyaṃ bindurīśvara eva ca ||

nādassadāśivaḥ prokta ityetā adhidevatāḥ |

makuṭe (-)

iḍā ca piṅgalā caiva vīṇādaṇḍasya pārśvayoḥ |
suṣumnā madhyagā tatra tanmadhye suṣirantathā ||

jīvaḥ prāṇa samāyuktastanmadhye saha sañcaran |
saṃyukto yogamākhyātaṃ yogī yogaṃ samāśrayet ||

siddhatantre (-)

anekārtha padārthākhyāssamūho vātmacechṛṇu |
paśyet bhoktantathā jñeyantathā paśyedyathārthataḥ ||

taddṛṣṭau kosmilokeyajñātra jñeyasya bhinnavat |

taccaitanyagataṃ jñānamātma uṣṇamivānale |
aneke naika bhāvaśca guṇaśca guṇadṛṣṭayet ||

manādi tatvajālāni karaṇaṃ kikaṇantathā |
manādi tatguṇāyuktam vedyāmātatsvayaṃ gate |

<p. 1044>

uttaram |

yadā jñānakriyā caiva ātmanaśca na samyutam |
dehethavā vivāda syāt sānnidhyesti tathā na cet ||

taduktaṃ sannidhībhāvo śavasuptau kva gacchati |
karaṇaṃ rahitaṃ cettu sannidhitvaṃ ca garhitam ||

sānnidhyamayaskāndamivā khyātantatkathaṃ bhavet |
ākarṣaṇantatsvabhāvaṃ hi ātmanastadudāhṛtam ||

deha vyāpāramityuktamātmanaiveha vidyate |
rūpaṃ ca dṛṣṭavaddehe anityaṃ bhautikaṃ bhavet ||

ātmarūpaṃ susūkṣmañcedaṣṭaṃ sthūlakāraṇam |
acetanantatassūkṣmaṃ sūkṣmarūpamanityatā ||

rūpārūpañcedātmā tadā ca vyutkramodbhavaḥ 
vibhāgavanaika evaṃ syāt kāṣṭhādagnivadeva cet ||

sarvamātmani dṛśaṃ rūpaṃ tasya satvaṃ layaṃñcagam |

<p. 1045>

candrarūpamivākhyaṃ cet pratyakṣaṃ śivarūpavat |
etaddehe sarūpisyājjaḍākhyaṃ bhautikaṃ bhavet ||

ākāśamivā rūpastva vikārī cetanastathā |
dehabandhaścalanatvāt gacchagacchānta tatbhavet ||

acidātmāna ciccāpi cidacicca kadācana |
samavāya vidhā sthityāmacintyo na cidacidya hi ||

vidyate kramacit cityā mato tasya sadannahi |

ātmāṇurākhyaddehena bandhoścamaguruddhṛtam |
harāpi vahanogaśco (**) vina(?) tato labhet ||

ātmādehaika deśastho layedekena cettathā |
dīpaprakāśavatjñeyaṃ cedekasthamudāhṛtam ||

dīpaṃ sparśāddaheddehamātra sparśotsatattathā |
yadi sarvaṃ ca yugapadyadyadeva hi ||

cchedyaśceddeha pūrṇastho tadānīṃ dṛkkathaṃ bhavet |

<p. 1046>

indriyaissaha vijñānaṃ yugapatsyāttadā mune |
dehamātre hi bodhopi dehānte līyate sakṛt |

sarvatrāvasthiti vyāptiryadyavasthā gatā gatā |
kīrtitā kathitaṃ jñeyaṃ pratyekañca tadindriyaiḥ ||
dehaprapañca saṃhāre kiṃ sthitātmā tadā vadet |

svāyambhuve (-)

yadyaśuddhirnnapuṃsosti saktirbhogeṣu kiṅkṛtā |
śuddhe sinatat bhogo jāgharīti vipaścitaḥ ||

mṛgendre (-)

caitanyandṛkkriyā rūpantadasstyātmani sarvadā |
sarvataśca yato muktau śrūyate sarvatomukham ||

tadapya bhāsamānatvāttanniruddhaṃ pratīyate |
vaiśyonāvṛta vīryasya so ta evāvimokṣaṇāt ||

pāśābhāve pāratantryaṃ vaktavyaṃ kinnibandhanam |
svābhāvikañcenmukteṣu muktaśabdo nivarttate ||

parākhye (-)

acetanamamūrtaṃ yat tatkathannayate paraḥ |

<p. 1047>

tatphalaṃ bhinnadeśasthaṃ vibhutvantvanuśobhitam |

anyatra (-)

vyañjanā yatra yatra syuśśarīrantatra tatra tu |
bhogārthaṃ syāt guṇavyakti vyāpitvantena gamyate ||

mataṅge (-)

niruddhaśaktayassarve śivārkka karacoditāḥ |
vikasatyaṇu patmāstu māyāsarasi vistṛte ||

pauṣkare (-)

paśuḥ paśutvasaṃruddha dṛkkriyā prasarastadā |

siddhatantre (-)

ātmāmāyodarāntattho kalādīnāṃ svabhāvataḥ |
caitanyaṃ caya etatjñe ekādaśeyute kṛtiḥ ||

guṇatrayādi sambandhāt bhogeṣvapi ca bhujyate |

siddhatantre (-)

sūkṣmadehe paśusthitvā tata sthūlaṃ svarūpayuk |
jāgradādi pañcāvasthā karmmaṇā bhogabhuktisthataḥ ||

kālottare (-)

puryaṣṭaka samāyogādūrdhvādhassaṃprayacchati |

<p. 1048>

cintye

annaprāṇamanojñānamānandamaya pañcakam |
annamādimayandevi anyonyaṃ sūkṣmarūpakam ||

ātmayuktenna rūpasya māyopādāna kāraṇam |
antarbahisthitasteṣu arūpaḥ pañcakośavat ||

taduktaṃ sarvasiddhāntasaṅgrahe (-)

ātmatvena bhramantyatra vādinaḥ kośakeñcake |
annaprāṇanmanojñāna māyākośastathātmanaḥ ||

ānandamayakośañca pañcakośā udīritāḥ |
manovikāre vihita ityānandamayo viduḥ ||

gṛhṇātyannamayātmānandehālokayataḥ khalu |
dehaḥ pariṇamitaṃ prāṇamapyārhatā viduḥ ||

vijñānamayamātmānaṃ bauddhā gṛhṇanti nāparam |
ānandamayamātmānaṃ vaidikāḥ kecidūcire ||

ahaṅkārātma vādī tu prāhuḥ prāyomanomayāḥ |

karmmakṛdrūpanṛttaṃ ca rūpanṛttaṃ ca vṛkṣavat |
rathaivāpya nataḥ kaścinnāṭyasya bahurūpavat ||

<p. 1049>

takṣa ātmaiva ityāhustathā dehendriyāṇi ca |

tathā skāndapurāṇe (-)

carmakṣiptāni rūpāṇi śailūṣo nipuṇo yathā |
sūtragranthita yantrāṇi pranarttayati līlayā ||

cintye (-)

dehendriya prakaraṇaṃ vidyātettapi vistṛtā |
(********************) ||

anyathā dṛśyate tena tathā dehendriyāṇi ca |

uttaram |

tathā tena ca dehātmā nakhakeśādivarjitaḥ |

dhārayanvastrābharaṇaṃ na svayaṃ kaścidvicārayet |
te tato varjyate dṛśyandehānyātmā tathāpi ca ||

cintye (-)

bhinna dehātma deveśa vidyārccanadṛḍhaḥ katham |
sā ca vannava dīkṣāyai vidhipūrvaka pūrvakam ||

pūrvakarmmakṣayaḥ karttā caraṇaṃ sarvadehinām |

manasākhyaṃ kvacidbuddhirbudhyā khyātaṃ kvacinmanaḥ |
cittākhyaṃ kvacijjīvo jivākhyaṃ cittakaṃ kvacit ||

<p. 1050>

kvacidātmā śivākhyātaḥ ātmākhyātaḥ kvacicchivaḥ |
sarveṣāmaprabuddhākhyāmitare hyātma bhāvataḥ ||

cintye (-)

dehacittañca vidyārthamātmetyātmāvṛtaḥ katham |
mahā prakāśa dīpākhyamāvāsa sthānameva ca ||

abhinnaṃ vidyate cātmā (********************) nnatā |

cintyavacanam |

bhuktotsāhantatassuptau dṛṣṭastatra jāgratā |
bodhyate bodhataścātmā dehānyassarvataścavit ||

saiva bodhavidajñopi dīyate cendriyādikam |
jāyate malaruddhe ātmā bodhendriyāṇiyuk ||

dṛtena samavasthopi dadatomātya rājavat |

grāma pradakṣiṇorājā krameṇāntargato yataḥ |
ātmā sahendriyavyāpī pañcāvasthāṃ gatastataḥ ||

tathā śivajñānabodhe (-)

avasthā pañcakantasya malaruddhasvadṛkkriyā |

<p. 1051>

cintye (-)

mukhe jāgraditi jñeyaṃ svapnantu hṛdayāntakam |
hṛdayādi samārabhya nābhyantantu suṣuptikam ||

tasmādadhasatātturyantu turyātītantu liṅgakam |
pañcatriṃśatpañcaviṃśattridvyeka iti tatvayuk ||

jāgrādi sthānamevaṃ hi pravattakamihocyate |
śrotratvaṅnetra jihvā ca ghrāṇañcaiva tu pañcakam ||

śabdasparśau rūparasau gandhaścaiva tu pañcakam |
vākpāṇi pādapāyuścopasthañcaiva tu pañcakam ||

vacanādāna gamanavisargānanda pañcakam |
prāṇopānastathā vyānodānaścaiva samānakaḥ ||

nāgakurmmau kūkaro devadatto dhanañjayaḥ |
manobuddhirahaṅkāracittajñānāni pañca ca ||

pañcatriṃśativarttante jāgraitāni vinirddiśet |
śabdādi vacanādiśca prāṇādi mana ādikam ||

ete caranti vai svapne māyārūpeṇajāgrataḥ |
jāgre viṣaya bhogaṃ syāt pratibhāsvapna eva ca ||

ayasāgnisamāyogāt viyogāgnivadāyasaḥ |

<p. 1052>

prāṇayukto manaścaiva kṣetrajñaśca suṣuptike |
ātmāmukhe bhuvormmadhye sthito jāgratprakīrtitaḥ ||

tathā cintyaviśve (-)

avastheyaṃ pumānjñeyo lalāṭe karaṇādibhiḥ |
ūrdhvādhovarttate jīvo jāgrādikaraṇaissaha ||

lūtikaṃ valaye lūto yathā bhramati nityaśaḥ |
jāgrat svapnasuṣuptistu turyañca tadītakam ||

avasthā pañca vijñeyā sadācāryopadeśataḥ |
ṣaṭtriṃśattatva saṃkhyābhirjjāgratkāle vibhāvayet ||

śrotrādi sthānake tasmin śabdādi jñāna saṃsmaret |
vāgādau vacanādīṃśca bhāvayennandikeśvara ||

viṃśatiśca visṛjyātha manādīṃśca vimarśayet |
manobuddhirahaṅkārānvisṛjettatradeśake ||

rāgamāyā kalāścāpi visṛjettaccaturyake |
vidyādiśuddhakālāntaṃ visṛjettattṛtītake ||

turyātītaṃ parantatvaṃ mānasānāṃ layaṃ bhavet |
manaso layataścaiva parāṃmuktiṃ samaśnute ||

cintya viśve (-)

jāgrādi dvividhaṃ jñeyaṃ bhavamokṣagatantu yat |

<p. 1053>

sthāṇu sthāne mahāmokṣaṃ bhavamārgamadhocyate |
sthūlaṃ sūkṣmaṃ susūkṣmaṃ ca atisūkṣmantathādhikam ||

sthūlaṃ jāgraditi jñeyā sūkṣmaṃ svapnamihocyate |
suṣuptistu susūkṣmaṃ syāt atisūkṣmanturīyakam ||

tatodhikaṃ turyātītamevaṃ pañcavidhaṃ smṛtam |
jāgratsthāne pradṛśyeta yogābhyāsavataḥ kramāt ||

jāgrabhūrvipravṛttiśca pratyāhāreṇa śāmyati |
dhāraṇena tyajet svapnandhyānenaiva suṣuptikam ||

samādhinājayetturyaṃ turyātītaṃ śivena tu |
śivena dṛśyate sarvaṃ jāgradityabhidhīyate ||

jāgrādi pañcāvasthāyāṃ jāgratsthāne pradarśayet |
sadgurorūpadeśena prāsāde naiva sidhyati ||

abhyāsa jñānayogena bhaktimārgeṇa bhāvayet |

evaṃ vātule (-)

jñānātītaṃ paraṃ śuddhaṃ sarvagaṃ sarvatomukham |
bhāvaṃ śivaṃ ca sambhāvya svasminnevaṃ vibhāvayet ||

evaṃ dhyātvā mahāyogī akhaṇḍita mahodayam |

kevalasakalaśuddham | svāyambhuve (-)

athātmā vimalobaddhaḥ punarmmuktaśca dīkṣayā |

<p. 1054>

vijñeyassa tridhāvasthaḥ kevalassakalomalaḥ ||

tatraiva |

acetano vibhurnnityoguṇahīno kriyaḥ prabhuḥ |
vyāghāta bhāgaśaktaśca śodhyo boddhaḥ khalaḥ paśuḥ ||

tathā kiraṇe (-)

paśurnnityo sumūrtajño niṣkriyo nirguṇo prabhuḥ |

svāyambhuve (-)

kalodvalita caitanyo vidyādarśita gocaraḥ |
rāgeṇa rañjitaścāpi buddhyādikaraṇairyutaḥ ||

māyādyavani paryanta tatva bhūtātmavartmani |
bhuṅkte tatra sthitānbhogān bhogaikarasikaḥ pumān ||

saṃsārī viṣayī bhoktākṣetrī kṣetrajña eva ca |
śarīre ceti baddhātmā sakalaścocyate budhaiḥ ||

suprabhede (-)

aśītiśca catuścaiva śata sāhasra bhedakaiḥ |
saṃprāpya yonibhedastu jīvanāmnā tu tatra ca ||

proktā ca sakalāvasthā jīvākhyānāntataśśṛṇu |

same karmmaṇi sañjāte kālāntaravaśāttataḥ |

<p. 1055>

tīvraśakti nipātena guruṇā dīkṣito yadā |
sarvajñassaśivo yadvat kiṃcijñatva vivarjitaḥ ||

śivatva vyaktisampūrṇassa rī na punastadā |

suprabhede (-)

śuddhāvasthā iyaṃ proktā sarvajñatvādibhirguṇaiḥ |
śuddhāvasthānamātmānaṃ śivarūpamiti smaret ||

trayovasthāścayo jñātvā punarjjanma na vidyate |

iti caturthasūtraṃ sampūrṇam ||

pañcamasūtram ||

śivajñānabodhe (-)

vidantyakṣāṇi puṃsārthānna svayaṃ sopi śambhunā |

cintye (-)

śivo bodhyādi sarvasya jñānāprakhyādhikaṃ ca kim |

uttaram |

arkasya sannidhau padma vakravatkarmmaṇastathā ||

tathā mataṅge (-)

niruddhaśaktayassarve śivārkakaracoditāḥ |
vikasantyaṇupatmāstu māyāsarasi vistṛte ||

<p. 1056>

śivadharmmottare (-)

na karoti yatassarvaṃ svabhogādyaṃ karoti ca |
asvatantryādakarttā yaḥ kiṃcitkarttāṇurandhavat ||

na vetti tatvatassarvaṃ tenājñaḥ puruṣaḥ paśuḥ |
siddhādhyavasitaṃ kiṃcit jñānāt kiṃcijña ucyate ||

tathā pauṣkare (-)

ajño janturanīśoyaṃ mātmā yasmādvijarṣabhāḥ |
sopi sāpekṣa eva syāt svapravṛttau ghaṭādivat ||

tathā niśvāse (-)

kiṃcijñassarvatopyātmā tato bodhyāvabodhakaḥ |

kiraṇe (-)

tasyaśuddhasya saṃbandhaṃ samāyāti śivātkalā |
tayorvellita caitanyo vidyādarśitagocaraḥ ||

rāgeṇa rañjitaścāpi pradhānena guṇātmanā |
buddhvādikaraṇāneka sambandhāt badhyate paśuḥ ||

tato niyati saṃśleṣāt svārjite viniyamyate |
kālenakāla saṃkhyā na kāryabhoga vimohitaḥ ||

evaṃ tatvakalābandhaḥ kiṃcijño dehasaṃyutaḥ |
māyābhogapariṣṣaktastanmayassahajāvṛtaḥ ||

<p. 1057>

tatassukhādikaṃ kṛsnaṃ bhogaṃ bhuṅkte svakarmmataḥ |

niśvāse (-)

sarvajñassarvagastasmādātmānaṃ bodhayecchivaḥ |
carācarākhya jantūnāṃ prāṇarūpa iti smṛtaḥ ||

siddhatantre (-)

cidrūpe jaḍasambandha janānāṃ vastu vastuni |
deveṣu cātmanāmeva sannidhau bodhajaṃ vadet ||

siddhatantre (-)

sarvalokāśca yoniśca śivasyāṅgaśca vigraham |
antaḥkaraṇa caitanyaṃ viditaṃ kṛtyapañcakam ||

tathā skānde (-)

pañcakṭya (********************) sya vimāyinaḥ |
idameva parandivyaṃ tāṇḍavaṃ parikīrtitam ||

pauṣkare (-)

karmmaṇārthasya saṃvittiḥ pūrvamālocanātmikā |
sandeha rūpiṇī paścādabhimānātmikā tataḥ ||

vyavasāyātmakī paścātkrameṇaiva vyavasthitāḥ |

cintyaviśvasādākhye (-)

<p. 1058>

sarvātmanāṃ ca jananaṃ maraṇaṃ ca tathaiva ca |
kāruṇyāt kleśamālokya teṣāṃ śambhuḥ punastathā ||

karmmaṇāṃ pācanārthāya sṛṣṭinnirmmāya pūrvavat |
duḥkhāni bhogamakhilaṃ bhojayennandikeśvara ||

malena paripāke tu pakvānāṃ parameśvaraḥ |
ācārya mūrtimāsthāya dīkṣayā niyatandadet ||

niśvāse (-)

ekaiva vastutaśśaivī vā śaktinnirmalā parā |
a nā bhāvinā śambhośśuceṣṇamiva prabhā ||

tathātma śivayossandhiśśivabodhaparaṃparā |

tathā vātulottare (-)

na śivena (********************) ktirahitaśśivaḥ |
gamavatyandhakāraṃ (*) śivaśśaktyārkaṣatguha ||

[iti pañcamaṃ sūtraṃ sampūrṇam] ||

[ṣaṣṭhamasūtram] ||

śivajñānabodhe

adṛśyaṃ cedasatbhāvo dṛśyañcejjaḍimā bhavet |
śambhostadvyatirekeṇa rūpaṃ jñeyaṃ vidurbudhāḥ ||

<p. 1059>

tathā vātulottare (-)

jñeyojñeyothavā sometyajñeyocita satbhavaḥ |
ajñe naiva cāto vā dvayaṃ sanmayata sthitaḥ ||

vātulottare (-)

sṛṣṭi sthiti vināśopi caturvidhe kāryadarśane |
ātmajñānena dṛśyet jaḍasyājjaḍatoguha ||

vātulottare (-)

lokatrayabhāvopi brahmaviṣṇoḥ parāspadam |
marīcikā svapnavat jñeyamasatyanniṣprayojanam ||

nimiṣāllayate cāpi kṣudrasyāpi svabhāvavat |

svacchande (-)

māyādyavani paryantamindra jālantu buddhitaḥ |
adṛśyet padārthañcenna ca tanniṣprayojanam |

uttaram |

pūrvantaddṛśyate jñānaṃ kintu lābhantathāpi ca ||

ātmajñānena sadasadidamuktena niṣphalam |
vāṅmanotītatvaṃ hi śivabhāvamiti smṛtam ||

<p. 1060>

prayojanaṃ kimasti syāttathāpi parameśvaraḥ |

uttaram |

sadbhogaṃ vāṅmanotītaṃ svayamevānubhūtimat ||

tadeva śivabhogaṃ ca tadeva paramaṃ sukham |

sarvajñānottare (-)

sarvabhāvaṃ parityajya abhāvaṃ bhāvayet sadā |

tathā niśvāse (-)

abhāve bhāvamālamvya bhāvaṃ kṛtvā nirāśrayam |
ātmasaṃsthaṃ manaḥ kṛtvā na kiṃcidapi cintayet ||

abhāve bhāvamāśritya bhāvalīnopyaśaṅkitaḥ |
vibhuriti samantavyo nātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

abhāvasya kuto bhāvo niṣkalasya mahātmanaḥ |
amano avyavasthānannirvāṇantasya tatpadam ||

sarvajñānottare (-)

advaita bhāvanāyuktassarvadātmani saṃsthitaḥ |
sarvagaṃ sarvadehasthaṃ prapaśyennātra saṃśayaḥ ||

pauṣkare (-)

na mokṣaṃ yāti puruṣa svasāmarthyāt kadācana |
muktvā prasādandevasya śivasyā śivahāriṇaḥ ||

anyatra |

<p. 1061>

jñāna dṛṣṭyā parogadyo rūpaśaraśśivaḥ |

sarvajñānottare (-)

yena vijñāyate sarvaṃ yatjñātvā tu śivo bhavet |

[iti ṣaṣṭhasūtraṃ sampūrṇam] ||


[saptamasūtram] ||


śivajñānabodhe (-)

nāciccitsannidhau kintu na cittasmādubhe mitaḥ |
prapañca śivayorvettā yassa ātmātayoḥ pṛthak ||

śivaṃ prapañca sadasatjñeyamātma dvayannapi |
ātmālābhārthataḥ paśyettanaujaṃ gandhapuṣpavat ||

ātmanassarvadoṣaṃ ca paramātmani tannayuk |
yadyapi tripadārthaṃ ca lavaṇāṃ bhodhivatsthitam |

kiraṇe (-)

anādimalasambandhāt kiñcijñoṇurmmayoditaḥ |
anādimalamuktatvāt sarvajño sau tataśśivaḥ ||

vāyavye (-)

yathā nādi pravṛttoyaṃ ghora saṃsārasāgarāt |

<p. 1062>

śivopi hi tathā nādissaṃsārānmocaka smṛtaḥ |

[saptamasūtram sampūrṇam] ||


[aṣṭamasūtram] ||

śivajñānabodhe |

sthitvā sahendriya vyādhaistvānna |

vetsīti bodhitaḥ |

muktvaitān guruṇānanyo
dhanyaḥ prāpnoti tatpadam ||

suprabhede

brāhmaṇāḥ kṣatriyā vaiśyāśśūdrāśśuddha kulodbhavāḥ |
ācāryāsteṣu vijñeyā nānyeṣāntu kadācana ||

śivadharmmottare (-)

saṃsārapaṅkanirmmagnaṃ yassamuddharate naram |
śivajñānena hastena kastena sadṛśaḥ pitā ||

cintya viśve (-)

anugrāhya striyaśśāstre vijñānapralayākalau |
tṛtīyassakalaścaiva ādyopi malamātrakaḥ ||

malakarmma samāyuktaḥ pralayākala eva ca |
malamāyā karmmayutassakalassobhidhīyate ||

sādhārotha nirādhārassādhārassakalasya tu |

<p. 1063>

nirādhārāhvayānyeṣāmeva dīkṣā mayoditā |
ācārya nirapekṣeṇa tīvraśaktyā tu śambhunā ||

yā kriyā kriyate sā tu nirādhāreti kīrtitā |
gurumūrtiṃ samāsthāya mandatīvrādi bhedayā ||

śaktyā śambhuśca kurute sā dīkṣā sādhikāriṇī |

varuṇa paddhatyām (-)

śivasyānugraho dīkṣā jāyate kṛtakarmmaṇām ||

sācānekavidhā proktā tatprapañcoyamucyate |
cākṣuṣī sparśadīkṣā ca vācakī mānasī tathā ||

śāstrī ca yogadīkṣā ca hautrītyādiranekadhā |
rajaḥ kuṇḍavatī hautrī sādvibhedā kiloditā ||

ādyā jñānavatī proktā kriyāvatya parā smṛtā |
vinejyānalakarmmādi manovyāpāramātrataḥ ||

dīkṣā jñānavatī proktā samyak tattvāvabodhajā |
ijyānalavatī yā tu kriyākauśala sambhavā ||

kriyavatyaya sā vekā nirbījā ca sa bījakā |

kālottare (-)

bālādīnāṃ tu nirbījā samayācāravarjitā |

varuṇapaddhatyām (-)

<p. 1064>

nityamātrādhikāratvāt samayinyatha putrake |
dīkṣā niradhikāraiva naimitte nādhikāriṇī ||

vijayottare (-)

pūjāyatastatastatra samayī nādhikārabhāk |
atha nirbījikā dīkṣā proktā sā dviprakārikā ||

ekā nirvāṇadā sadyo dvitīyā deha pātataḥ |

siddhānte (-)

prārabdha sañcitā gāmi(?) karmmajālaṃ viśodhyate |
yayātyanta viraktānāṃ sadyo nirvāṇadā bhavet ||

prārabdha karmmaṇāṃ bhogaṃ yathā sā muktimantarā |
yānti bālādayaścaiva svecchā nirvāṇadā bhavet ||

kiraṇe (-)

prārabdhakarmmanāśe tu svayandehopapadyate |

kālottare (-)

sa bījā caiva śaktānāṃ samayācārasamyutā |
tetra bālyā prayatnena mokṣasiddhi samīhitā ||

varuṇa paddhatyām (-)

sa bījā ca bhaveddīkṣā sādhakācāryayorapi |

ṣaṭsahasrikāyām (-)

<p. 1065>

nityaṃ naimittikaṃ kāmyamācāryasyoditaṃ trayam |
nityaṃ kāmyaṃ sādhakasya svaśāstroktaṃ ṣaḍānana ||

varuṇapaddhatyām (-)

sarvatraivādhikāritvāt sādhikāraiva sā tayoḥ |
sādhyamantrābhiṣekācca sādhake sā prakīrtitā ||

sarvavidyābhiṣekeṇa bhavedācārya gocare |

ṣaṭsahasrikāyām (-)

dvidhā nirvāṇa dīkṣā ca laukikī śivadharmmiṇī |
adharmmamātra saṃśuddhā proktā sā lokadharmmiṇī ||

dharmmādharmmātmakaṃ karma prāgāgāmi vicitrakam |
sañcitaṃśodhyate yena saivoktā śivadharmmiṇī ||

vātule (-)

gurupadeśa kramato dīkṣitānāṃ kramāt bhavet |
samayaṃ ca viśeṣaṃ ca nirvāṇaṃ cābhiṣecanam ||

varuṇapaddhatyām (-)

kriyayā vāthaśaktyā vā dīkṣā sā sarvatomatā |
dīkṣayā mucyate dehī trividhāt bhavabandhanāt ||

kāmike (-)

kriyādīkṣā prabuddhānāṃ jñānadīkṣāmanīṣiṇām |

<p. 1066>

mucyate jñānadīkṣāyā vinā pāśānnamocanam ||

varuṇapaddhatyām (-)

sā ca dīkṣādhva saṃśuddhā sa cādhvā ṣaḍvidha smṛtaḥ |
mantraḥ padāni varṇāśca vyāptānīha samantataḥ ||

varṇāstu bhuvanairvyāptāstatvairvyāptānitāni ca |
kalābhistāni tatvāni vyāptānīha kalā kramāt ||

ityadhvanāṃ vicintyātha ṣaḍadhvavyāpinaṃ param |
dhyātvā śaktinnadūrdhve tu bhaveyuḥ paramaṃ padam ||

nivṛttau pārthivantatvañcintyamekaṃ kṣakārakam |
kālāgni prabhṛtīnāṃ tu purāṇyaṣṭottaraṃ śatam ||

antyātpadānmahādeva padāvadhivilomataḥ |
vyomavyāpi padānyaṣṭāviṃśatiḥ parisaṃkhyayā ||

sadyo jātaśca hṛdayandvau mantrau parikīrtitau |
guṇaṃ gandhādiśabdāntaṃ pañcabrahmā ca kāraṇam ||

pratiṣṭhāyāmavādīni trayoviṃśati saṃkhyayā |
prakṛtyantāni tatvāni jñātavyāni svabhāvataḥ ||

trayoviṃśati varṇāśca hādināntāvilomataḥ |
jñātavyānyamareśādi ṣaṭpañcāśatpurāṇi ca ||

<p. 1067>

maheśvarādyarūpyanna padānāmeka viṃśatiḥ |
śirovāmaśca mantraudvau catvāri tu guṇā smṛtāḥ ||

rasādiśabda paryantā viṣṇuratra ca kāraṇam |

vidyāyāṃ saptatatvāni puruṣādīnyanukramāt |
vāmādi bhuvanānāṃ ca vijñeyā saptaviṃśatiḥ ||

dhyānāharapadā (**) na vyāpinīti padāditaḥ |
padānāṃ viṃśatirmmantrau (*)  (********************) ||

(********************) |
rūpaḥ sparśaśca śabdaśca guṇārudrastu kāraṇam |
śāntau tu trīṇi tatvāni vidyeśvara sadāśivaḥ ||

ṇa (**) kāśca trayovarṇā mantrau vaktra tanucchadau |
vāmākhyādi purāṇyā (********************) |
(********************) ||

vyomavyāpina ityantānyuktānīha vilomataḥ |
guṇau sparśaśca śabdaścaddhāvī (**) kāraṇam ||

śāntyātīta kalāyāntu śivatatvaṃ vyavasthitam |
nivṛttyādi purāṇyatra bhavanti daśa pañca (**) ||

<p. 1068>

visargādyā kārāntā varṇāṣṣoḍaśakīrtitāḥ |
bhavatyeko guṇaśśabdaḥ kāraṇantu sadā śivaḥ ||

cintye (-)

ityekādaśamantresyādekāśīti padaṃ bhavet |
akṣarāṇyeka pañcāśaccaturviṃśacchatadvayam ||

ṣaṭtriṃśattatvamevaṃ hi kalā pañcaka ucyate |

mataṅge (-)

sitaṃ caivāsitaṃ karmmaloke tāvatprakīrtitam |
hiṃsādikaṃ karmmayat syāttadakarmma ca karmmiṇām ||

vāpī kūpataṭākādyaissitametat prakīrtitam |
etat koṭidvayopetaṃmucitaṃ sarvajantuṣu ||

apekṣya vedavidhyuktamagniṣṭomātmike pathi |
karmmākarmma viśeṣosmin proktantaddhisitāsitam ||

etāvattrividhaṃ karmma neṣṭaṃśāstre śivodaye |

cintye (-)

pūrvajanmakṛtaṃ karmmabhogena pariśuṣyati |
iha janmani yatprāptaṃ jñānena śithilaṃ kuru ||

tathānyatra (-)

<p. 1069>

prārabdhaṃ bhogato na śyāt sañcitaṃ hanti dīkṣayā |
āgāmi dhyānapūjāyāmiti śāstrasya niścayaḥ ||

yogaje (-)

sthūlaṃ ca sūkṣmakaṃ caiva dvividhaṃ samayaṃ bhavet |

acintye (-)

lokāyatoya bauddhaścārhato mīmāṃsa eva ca |
māyāvādaṃ pāñcarātraṃ ṣaḍete samayā bahiḥ ||

anyatra |

manurbṛhaspatirddakṣo gautamodharamoṅgirāḥ |
yogīśvaraḥ pracedāśca śatātapa parāśarau ||

saṃvartteśanasaśśaṅkhalikhitāvatrireva ca |
vedoktakarmmabharitā dharmmaśāstra pravarttakāḥ ||

suprabhede (-)

brahmacārī gṛhasthaśca vānaprasthaśca bhikṣukaḥ |
brahmacārī dvidhā jñeyo bhautiko naiṣṭhikastathā ||

kūrmme (-)

udāsīnassādhakaśca gṛhastho dvividho bhavet |
kuḍumbabharaṇāyattassādhakosau prakīrtitaḥ ||

ṛṇāni trīṇyapākṛtya tyaktvā bhāryā dhanādikam |
ekākī vicaredyastu sa udāsīna ucyate ||

<p. 1070>

cintya viśve (-)

yatayastrividhā jñeyāstapasvī viduṣastathā |
vidvāniti tridhā proktāsteṣāṃ lakṣaṇamucyate ||

tapaścāndrāyaṇādikamiti santāne (-)

catuṣṣaṣṭhi kalāścaiva ṣaṭkarmmāṇi tathaiva ca |
yogaśāstrāṇi sarvāṇi vedāntaṃ jyotiṣantathā |

mataṅge (-)

sāṃkhya siddhāntamārgaṃ ca jñātvā vai deśiko bhavet |

śaivapurāṇe (-)

brāhaṃ ca vaiṣṇavaṃ pādyaṃ śaivaṃ bhāgavatantathā |
bhaviṣyannāradīyaṃ ca mārgaṇḍeyamataḥ param ||

āgneyaṃ brahmavaivartaṃ laiṅgaṃ vārāhameva ca |
skāndaṃ ca vāmanaṃ proktaṃ kaurmmaṃ mātsyaṃ ca gāruḍam ||

brahmāṇḍaṃ ceti puṇyoyaṃ purāṇānmānukramāt |
ṛgyajussāmādharvaṇāścaturvedāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

devikālottare (-)

jñānotpattinimittantu kriyācaryā prakīrtitā |

suprabhede (-)

yogāt jñānaṃ samādāya jñānatatvaṃ sadābhyaset |

<p. 1071>

śaive (-)

jñānādeva hi mukti syānnānyathā karmmakoṭibhiḥ |

cintye (-)

anyathā bahavomuktiśśāstre ca varānane |
śivatulyaṃ labhenmuktiridānīṃ kathyate mayā ||

niśvāse (-)

siddhānta saṅgrahe ca ||

lokāyatika pakṣe tu tatvaṃ bhūta catuṣṭyam |
iṣṭalokāt paronānya svargosti narako na ca ||

śivalokādayo mūḍhaiḥ kalpyantenya prakārakaiḥ |
svargānubhūtimṛṣṭāṣṭidvyaṣṭa varṣavadhūratiḥ ||

sūkṣmavastrasugandhasṛk candanādi niṣevaṇam |
narakānubhavo vedaśāstravyādhyādhyupadravaḥ ||

mokṣastu maraṇaṃ prāṇa saṃjñavāyu nivarttanam |

sarvamatopanyāse (-)

tadeṣāṃ śruti vākyānāṃ śabdamātraṃ hi devatā |
jyotiṣṭomādyanuṣṭhānādapūrvaḥ kaścidārjitaḥ ||

svargādeḥ phalarūpasya pradānasya tu devatā |
karmmamīmāṃsakāḥ prāhuritthaṃ svamatalakṣaṇam ||

<p. 1072>

tathā mṛgendre (-)

na jātu devatā mūrttirasmadādi śarīravat |
viśiṣṭaiśvarya sampannastato naitannidarśitam ||

atastvevaṃ ghaṭo nyāyaśśabdatvādindra śabdavat |
jñānasaṃskāra saṃjñānaṃ vedanā rūpayorapi ||

samūha skandhaśabdārthastattatsantati vācakaḥ |
jñāna santatirevātra vijñāna skandhamucyate ||

saṃskāraskandha ityukto vāsanāntantu santatiḥ |
sukhaduḥkhādikā buddhissādīpekṣātmikā tathā ||

vedanaskandha ityuktassaṃjñā skandhāntanāvayat |
rūpaskandho bhavatyatra mukti bhūtasya saṃhatiḥ ||

cintye (-)

śāstrāṇi samayāścaiva anyonyena viparyayāḥ |
eteṣā muktikolābhādatitvaṃ yadi sṛgvisi ||

ekena naitadityuktamabhinnanyāyataḥ priye |
sarveṣāṃ tu kvaciddṛṣṭe sthite santi taruttamam ||

vedāgameṣu śāstreṣu īśvarāḍhyoti kīrtitaḥ |

tathā niśvāse devī (-)

vedaśāstra purāṇajña pāñcarātretihāsayoḥ |

<p. 1073>

yoginaśca tathācānye kupatheṣvapi ye sthitāḥ |
kutarke mohayitvā tu svadehandarśayanti te ||

devi cātra bruvantyeva gatiratrakutonvitaḥ |
pakṣapāto bhave deṣo mokṣassarvatra vā bhavet ||

evaṃ me saṃśayo deva yatsatyaṃ tat brūhi me |

śivadharmmottare (-)

vidhivākyamidaṃ śaivannārthavādaśśivātmakam |
yadyathāvasthitaṃ vastu guṇadoṣa svabhāvataḥ ||

yāvatphalaṃ ca tatpuṇyaṃ sarvajñaśca tathā vadet |
rāgajñānādibhiddoṣaiḥ grastatvādamṛtaṃ vadet ||

te ceśvare na vidyante brūyātsa kathamanyathā |
apāstā śeṣadoṣeṇa sarvajñena śivena yat ||

praṇītamamalaṃ vākyantatpramāṇanna saṃśayaḥ |
tasmādīśvara vākyāni śraddheyāni vipaścitā ||

makuṭe (-)

vedāntārthamayaṃ jñānaṃ siddhāntaṃ paramaṃ śubham |
vedasārārthadaṃ jñeyamanyatvanyārtha sādhakam ||

kāmike (-)

<p. 1074>

siddhānto vedasāratvādanyatve tatbahiṣkṛtaḥ |
siddhānta vihitācāro vaidikācāra ucyate ||

ajite (-)

pañcavaktradharo bhūtvā pañcabhistairmukhairapi |
vedādi granthajālaṃ yadavatārayati prabhuḥ ||

kāmike (-)

laukikaṃ vaidikaṃ caiva tathādhyātmikameva ca |
atimārgaṃ ca mantrākhyantatra bhedamanekadhā ||

sadyo vāmamaghoraṃ ca puruṣeśānamūrttayaḥ |
pratyekaṃ pañcavaktrāsyustairuktaṃ laukikādikam ||

svāyambhuve (-)

vedādi jñānabhedena śivajñānamihoditam |
cintāmaṇirivātrāsau sthitassarvasya kāraṇam ||

dharmmasādhana saṃvittirāmnāyādeva jāyate |
tanmūlatvāt smṛteścāpi tābhyāmevāparasya ca ||

purāṇādīni śāstrāṇi sādarannityamāśrayet |
vedamūlatayānyāni pravṛttānyapi sattama ||

siddhānta saṅgrahe (-)

aṅgopāṅga vedāsyurvedasyaivopakārikāḥ |

<p. 1075>

vedāṅgāni ṣaḍetāniśīkṣāvyākaraṇāni ca |
niruktañjyotiṣaṃ kalpaṃ cchandovacitirityapi ||

mimāṃsā nyāyaśāstraṃ ca purāṇaṃ smṛtirityapi |
catvāryetānyupāṅgāni bahiraṅgāni tāni vai ||

kāmike (-)

ṛgyajussāmādharvāṇi puruṣādyananotbhavāḥ |
paścimādvāmavaktrantu vāmāddakṣiṇamuttamam ||

dakṣiṇāt puruṣaśreṣṭha utarotrameva vahi |
pūrvānanāttataśśreṣṭhantasmāt siddhāntamuttamam ||

siddhāntātparamaṃ jñānaṃ neti śastrasya niścayaḥ |
aṣṭāviṃśati tantrāṇi siddhāntamiti kīrtitam ||

ratnatraye (-)

siddhānta eva siddhāntaḥ pūrvapakṣāstataḥ pare |
siddhāntassevyate sadbhiraśaktipāta pavitritaiḥ ||

tathā kāmike (-)

ādāvabhūdvidhā jñānamadhikāri vibhedataḥ |
parāpara vibhāgena patipāśātma darśakam ||

śivaprakāśakaṃ jñānaṃ śivajñānaṃ paraṃ smṛtam |
vedādyapara vijñānaṃ paśupāśārtha darśakam ||

<p. 1076>

yathā vilakṣaṇañcakṣu kṣapāyānnṛbiḍālayoḥ |
tathā vilakṣaṇaṃ jñānamevametat parāparam ||

śivadharmmottare (-)

āgamatvepi sāmānyekaḥ pradveṣaśśivātmake |
anāyāsena yatproktā muktirekena janmanā ||

evamekena bhavikāṃ vimuktiṃ paratasthitām |
vihāyāneka bhavikāṃ kaḥ prājñaḥ pratipadyate ||

taduktanniśvāse (-)

śāstreṇa sidhyate siddhissidhāntastena saṃsmṛtaḥ |
śivo deśikadehasthaḥ prāṇyanugrahakārakaḥ ||

parākhye (-)

sarvakarttā mahānvidyāt sarvavettā maheśvaraḥ |
sarvakṛtyeṣu tatjñānaṃ vyā (********************) ||

(********************) śśivaḥ |
āgapi sarvajño guṇamāhātmya darśanāt ||

ubhayorjñāpakatvena doṣastvanyonya (*****) bhavet |
jñāpakaṃ vartate śāstrantatkarttā vartate śivaḥ ||

jñātṛjñāpakayoścaiva na doṣastvitaretaraḥ |

mṛgendre (-)

<p. 1077>

sarvajñassarvakartṛtvāt sādhanāṅgaphalaissaha ||

yo yajjānāti kurute sa tathaiveti susthitam |

parākhye (-)

kriyādi jñānaparyantaṃ sadyaṅmārgañcaturvidham |

taduktaṃ śivajñāne (-)

caryāpādandāsamārgaṃ putramārgaṃ kriyāṃ viduḥ |
sahamārgaṃ yogapādaṃ sanmārgaṃ jñānameva ca ||

atha caryā kriyāpādaṃ yogapādantathaiva ca |
jñānapādaṃ kramāccaiva śivena paribhāṣitam ||

etaccaturvidhaṃ mārgaṃ sālokyādi phalapradam |

cintya viśve (-)

śivasamānatārūpaṃ śivavigrahameva hi |
sakale niṣkale caiva sarvatraiva samānatā ||

sāyujyamiti tatproktaṃ sārūpyaṃ mūrtitulyatā |
sāmīpyaṃ mūrti sāmīpyaṃ svecchā vigrahadhāraṇāt ||

śivalokādi saṃprāptissālokyaṃ muktināmataḥ |
etaccatuṣṭayaṃ muktissāyujyañcottamaṃ bhavet ||

kāmike (-)

dāsamārgaṃ śivodyāna liṅgabiṃbālayādikṛt |

<p. 1078>

śaiva narttanatistotragān kudrohimarddakaḥ |

śivajñānabodha saṅgrahe (-)

kriyāmūrttermaheśasya ālayeṣu samāhitaḥ |
śanaissammārjanaṃ kuryānmārjjanyāmṛdusūkṣmayā ||

tallakṣaṇamuktaṃ suprabhede (-)

dvādaśāṅgulamānena mārjjijālena mārjanam |
nālikerasya patrāṇāṃ sārātbahu ca saṃyutāt ||

aratnimātra māyāmantanmūle rajju bandhanam |
dvividhā mārjanī proktāhyathamārjana karmmaṇi ||

śivadharmme (-)

nāhāravaśa jīrṇāyā na bandhyā kṣīṇa vatsalā |
rogārttā navasūtā vā tyājyāgomaya saṅgrahe ||

kha saṃsthaṃ gomayaṃ grāhyaṃ sthāne vā patite śubhe |
uparyadhaśca saṃtyajya pratyagrañcatuvarjitam ||

vastra pūtena toyena yaḥ kuryādupalepanam |
paśyanpariharan jantūn cāndrāyaṇaphalaṃ labhet ||

śivajñāne (-)

ātmārāmodbhavaiḥ puṣpaissamādāya śivasya tu |
mālāṃ saṃgrathayitvā tu yo dadyāt parameṣṭhine ||

<p. 1079>

yaḥ kuryāttu maheśāya puṣpārāmakriyā vidhim |
stotragānādikaṃ sarvaṃ yaḥ kuryāddāsamārgakaḥ ||

kāmike (-)

putramārgīśivārcādi japahomaparāyaṇaḥ |
praveśakaśśivajñānī aupadeśika eva ca ||

vātule (-)

mūrtiṃ sadāśivīṃ vidyām śuddhasphaṭika sannibhām |
pañcapañca bhujairyuktāṃ pañcavaktraṃ smitānanām ||

daśāyudha samopetāṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām |
unmanī sahitaṃ śambhuṃ vinyaseddhṛdayena tu ||

vijane prayatassarvaṃ vidyādehaṃ vicintayet |
parāśakti samāyuktaṃ mūrdhnimadhye tu vinyaset ||

tadūrdhve śivamāvāhya sadhojñānamavāpnuyāt |

jñānaratnāvalyām (-)

kintu dehāvasānena yaḥ pūjayati bhaktitaḥ |
sa śivassarvakṛcchambhurjjīvanmuktassakathyate ||

kāmike (-)

sahamārggi bhavetyakta saṃsārīśucimantrayuk |
samadṛṅnirahaṃkārī śivayogakṛtaśramaḥ ||

<p. 1080>

suprabhede (-)

gudācca dvyaṅgulādūrdhvaṃ meḍhrāttu dvyaṅgulādadhaḥ |
mūlādhāramiti jñeyaṃ tadvijñeyamudāhṛtam ||

ādhāraṃ gudamityuktaṃ svādhiṣṭhānantu liṅgakam |
maṇipūrannābhideśe hṛtpadmagamanāhatam ||

viśuddhiḥ kaṇṭhadeśe tu ājñākodaṇḍamadhyagā |
ādhāramāsanaṃ proktamādheyaḥ paramaśśivaḥ ||

makuṭe (-)

ṣaḍādhārādi devānāṃ śṛṇuṣvevaṃ maheśvara |
vighneśo bhairavaścaiva kṣetrapālaśca caṇḍikā ||

mūlādhārādi devāsyu svādhiṣṭhānamatha śruṇu |
pratiṣṭhāśuddha bhairiṇyā bhavānī ṛṣī padminī ||

padmāsanā padmayogī svādhiṣṭhānādi devatāḥ |
tulārākṣi nīlarākṣīrākṣīkailā sphuliṅginī ||

upābhyuṣṇīṣikā caiva vaśinī ca triśaṅkarī |
tapanī navanī caiva maṇipūraka devatāḥ ||

maṇipūramidaṃ proktamanāhatamataśśruṇu |
kāśanīśātanī caiva śocikā veṇiveṇikā ||

akṣiṇī caiva cāmuṇḍī jyeṣṭhā durgā varāṭikā |

<p.1081>

araṇī svaraṇī caiva cādhidevāstvanāhate |
anāhatamiti proktaṃ viśuddhernnāma tacchruṇu ||

manāṭī puṣpaṭīstīṭī śṛṅgi ca cchūrparāṭinī |
rātriśca dāmakariṇī jayā pūjī ca meva ca |
alpāśinī makārākṣī dūlvāśī āpacāriṇī ||

kalāsīkamalā caiva viśuddhasyādhi devatā |
viśuddhi devatā proktā ājñādevamatha śruṇu ||

ante sundarī ānandī ājñāyā adhidevatā |
ṣaḍādhāramidaṃ jñeyaṃ atideva samanvitam ||

vāyavye (-)

samādhinā ca sarvatra prajñāloke pravartate |
yadarthamātra ni samamito dadhivatsthitam ||

svarūpaśūnyaṃ yatbhāti tatsamādhyabhidhīyate |

tathā cintyaviśve (-)

mūlādhārākhya kālāgnermmaṇḍalopari saṃsthitām |
ādhārāṇāmaśeṣāṇāṃ bhedinī bodhinīpakā ||

sṛṣṭyantomṛta saṃvāhī śivaśaktisvarūpiṇī |
āplāvayantī sarvatra siddhimukti pradāyinī || 

evaṃ kuṇḍalinī proktā cātiguhyā mahodayā |

<p. 1082>

kāmike (-)

sanmārgītyakta saṃsārassamatvaśucimatvayuk |
tripadārtha parijñāna śivayogakṛta śramaḥ ||

putrī kṛta janaśśaivācāryāsantātikaśca saḥ |
śuddhātmanāṃ hitaṃ śāstrantrāyate yadbhavārṇavāt ||

tacchāsana paritrāṇāt śāstramityabhidhīyate |

cintyaviśve (-)

śāśvatanturya rahitamānandaṃ paramaṃ padam |
tripuṭī jñānahīnaṃ yat proktantatparamaṃ padam ||

tathā skānde (-)

dhāraṇadhyāna yuktasya samādhirbhavati dhruvam |
yatsāmarasyamanayorjjīvātma paramātmanoḥ ||

yatparityaktasaṅkalpaṃ samādhirabhidhīyate |
pratipattessamādhau tu saṅkalparahitātmanaḥ ||

jñeyaṃ jñātā tathā jñānametadrūpaṃ vilīyate |

kāmike (-)

uttarottaravaiśiṣṭyapaṭale |

sanmārgādi krameṇāpi vaiśiṣṭyamiha sammatam |
sanmārgī sahamārgī ca putramārgī tathā paraḥ ||

<p. 1083>

dāsamārgī caturtheṣāṃ pratilomādviśiṣyate |

śivadharmmottare (-)

adhyayañcādhyapanaṃ vyākhyāśravaṇa cintane |
iti pañcaprakāroyaṃ jñānayajñaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

uttarottara vaiśiṣṭyaṃ sarveṣāṃ parikīrtitam |
atha pūjādyagnikāryādyairbhedairbahuvidhai smṛtaḥ ||

karmmayajñassamākhyātasta paścāndrāyaṇādikam |
svādhyāyaśca japaḥ proktaśśivamantrākhya saṃsthitaḥ ||

dhyāna yajñassamākhyātaśśivacintārmuhurmuhuḥ |
pañcānāmapi yajñānāṃ jñānayajño vimuktidaḥ ||

karmmayajñāttapo yajño viśiṣṭho daśabhirguṇaiḥ |
japayajñastapo yajñāt jñeyaśśataguṇādhikaḥ ||

jñāna dhyānātmakassūkṣmaśśivayogo mahāmakhaḥ |
viśiṣṭassarvayajñānāṃmasaṃkhyātairmahāguṇaiḥ ||

yasmāttasmādviśuddhoyamapavargaphalapradaḥ |

śivadharmmottare (-)

ārambhakāle śravaṇaṃ kriyākāle tu cintanam |
niścayāddhavanantasya niṣṭhākāle prasannatā ||

<p. 1084>

cintyaviśvasādākhye (-)

yāvatkālaṃ śivajñānandrayī bhavati tasya vai |
tāvatkālaṃ ca karttavyaṃ śravaṇādi viśeṣataḥ ||

śivadharmmottare (-)

jñānaṃ vikalpa bahulaṃ rāgādyaiḥ kaluṣīkṛtam |
tadajñānanna śudhyarthaṃ kaluṣodakavadbhavet ||

tatra jñānājñānayorllakṣaṇamāha |

yadā prasannamekāgraṃ stimitodadhivatsthitam |
tadā jñānamiti proktamajñāna timirāpaham ||

iti prasannaṃ yatjñānaṃ bhāvānāmayamuttamam |
rāgādyairaparāmṛṣṭantadvijñeyaṃ vimuktidam ||

ajñāne sati rāgādyairdharmmādharmmau ca tadvaśāt |
dharmmādharmma vaśāt puṃsāṃ śarīramupajāyate ||

śarīre sati satkleśassarvaissaṃyujyate yataḥ |
tataḥ kleśa vyapohārtha punarddehanna kārayet ||

jagatastasya sambodhādajñānaṃ vinivarttate |
tatkṣayācca śarīreṇa na punassaṃ prayujyate ||

mṛte śivapuraṃ gacchet trisapta kula saṃyutaḥ |
kalpakoṭiśatandivyaṃ sevyamānaṃ satiṣṭhati ||

<p. 1085>

kradante viṣṇubhavane tāvatkāla (**) syati |
viṣṇulokāccyuto brāhmantatassaṃprāpyamodate ||

sambhogairvividhaissūkṣmaistāvatkālamanuttamaiḥ |
prajāpatīndra gandharva yakṣa (**) nukramāt ||

(********************) |
kāle mahati viprāṇāṃ prajñāśīla guṇānvitaḥ |
tatassa (********************) gīndraṃ samupāsate ||

tatsaṃparkkācchivajñānaṃ prāpya yoganniṣevate |
yogādvirakta saṃyogādāpnoti paramaṃ padam ||

vratāni dāna nita yajñā(-)
ssannyāsa tīrthāśrama karmmayogāḥ |
svargīyametacchubhamadhruvaṃ ca
jñānāddhruvaṃ śāntikaraṃ mahārtham ||

svātma bhogādhipatyaṃ syācchivassarvajagatpatiḥ |
kecit tatraiva mucyante jñānayogaratānarāḥ ||

āvarttante punaścānye saṃsāre bhogatatparāḥ |
tasmādvipaścillokeṣu bhogāsaktiṃ vivarjayet ||

viraktiśānta śuddhātmā śivajñānamavāpnuyāt |

niśvāse (-)

<p. 1086>

yastu phalandānayajñādi karmmaṇā samupārjitam |
tadasyāpyupabhogena kṣayamāyetyaśeṣataḥ ||

yajñāt svargaphalāvāptistatkṣayāt punarāgamaḥ |

suprabhede (-)

anyeṣu paśudharmmeṣu svarga eva phalaṃ hi tat |
etaddhi śivaśāstreṣu bhuktimuktipradāyakam ||

sarvaśāstraṃ samutsṛjya śivaśāstreṣu yojayet |

tatraiva |

śivaloke nivāsasyādanya labhyanna devataiḥ |
bhuktvā tu vipulānbhogānpralaye samupasthite ||

jñānayogaṃ samāsādya sa tatraiva vimucyate |
na teṣāṃ punarāvṛttirghore saṃsārasāgare ||

sarvajñāssarvagāśśuddhāḥ paripūrṇā maheśvarāḥ |
śivatulyabalāssiddhāḥ paraṃ śivapuraṃ gatāḥ ||

atyalpamapi yaddattaṃ śivajñānātmavedine |
tanmahāpralayaṃ yāvaddāturbhogāya kalpyate ||

mṛgendre (-)

māyākāryomareśādi rudrasthāneṣu yatsukham |
aparantatpadaṃ vidyādānandādi padasthitiḥ ||

<p. 1087>

śivadharmmottare (-)

aneka bhavikāmuktirbhavataḥ kenakāryate |
tasmādatraika bhavikāmuktirjñānena niścitā ||

suprabhede (-)

jñāne naiva tu tattulyaṃ prāptastatra na saṃśayaḥ |

śivadharmmottare (-)

ajñānapāśabandhatvādamuktaḥ puruṣa smṛtaḥ |
jñānena mocitaṃ yasmāttasmāt jñānaṃ viśiṣyate ||

saṃsārabījamajñāna saṃsāryajñaḥ pumāṃ smṛtaḥ |
jñānāttasya vimukti syāt prakāśāttu tamo yathā ||

śivajñānātparaṃ jñānaṃ tatsamaṃ ca na vidyate |

suprabhede (-)

jñānaṃ pravarttate vatsa bhrāntirnirnāśanāya ca |
adhvaśreṇi vināśāya śivavyaktikarāya ca ||

andhakāra vadajñānaṃ jñānandīpavaducyate |
jñeyaṃ bhāskaravatproktantasmāt jñānaṃ viśiṣyate ||

sūta saṃhitāyām (-)

ātmanaḥ paramāmuktirjñānenaiva karmmaṇā ||

śaiva purāṇe (-)

<p. 1088>

jñānā deva hi muktisyānnānyathā karmmakoṭibhiḥ |
yaścaśambhoḥ prasādena guroścaiva prasādataḥ ||

jāyate tacchivajñānannānyathā satyamīritaḥ |

vātule (-)

āditya sannidhau raśmissūryakāntepi coditam |
ācāryasannidhau jñānamātmanyeva tathoditam ||

suprabhede (-)

sarvatatvāni bhūtāni dṛśyante cātma eva hi |

cintye (-)

yassākṣī sukhaduḥkhānāṃ lokesmin sarvavastuni |
aṇoraṇu mahīyāṃśca mahato yatparātparam ||

pauṣkare (-)

karmmanāśānmalasyāpi vipāke sahakāriṇī |
patatyunmīlinī śaktistadānugraha rūpiṇī ||

tasyāṃ patitamātrāyāṃ malayonirmmalātmikā |
śaktirnnirvartate tasyāṃ nivṛttāyāṃ mahātmanaḥ ||

punāti sādhikāreṇa yaṃ vāpi parameśvaraḥ |
yathānugraha rūpiṇyāśśakternnati nirodhikā ||

<p. 1089>

malasya kṣīyate śaktissā dīkṣā śāmbhavī kriyā |

tathā kiraṇe (-)

tīvraśakti nipātena ityādi |

śivadharmmottare (-)

na śruṇoti na cāghrāti na rasyati na paśyati |
na ca sparśaṃ vijānāti na ca saṅkalpate manaḥ ||

na cābhimanyate kiñcinna ca budhyādi kāṣṭhavat |
evamīśvarake līnassamādhisthaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

suprabhede (-)

svabhāvajñānato muktassajīvanmukta eva hi |
samatvaṃ sukhaduḥkhābhyāntatpriyā priyayossamam ||

devikālottare (-)

samastu mitrāmitre ca samaloṣṭāśma kāñcanaḥ |
yasyāṃ yasyāmavasthāyāṃ tasyāntasthāṃ smarecchivam ||

kālottare (-)

nidrāyāṃ bodhayeccittaṃ vikṣiptaṃ kṣamayetpunaḥ |
pakṣadvaya parityāge saṃprāpte naiva cālayet ||

nirāśrayaṃ yadā cittaṃ sarvālambanavarjjitam |
naiva sthāna vinirmmuktaṃ vijñeyaṃ muktilakṣaṇam ||

ratnatraye (-)

<p. 1090>

tayā hi vimalodāra gambhīre cinmahodadhau |
svātmani pravilīyante dhanyā hi śivayoginaḥ ||

śivadharmmottare (-)

dharmmarajvā vrajatyūrdhvaṃ pāparajvā vrajatyadhaḥ |
dvayaṃ jñānāsi na cchitvā videhaṃ śāntimṛcchati ||

jñānāmṛtarasoyena sakṛdā svādino bhavet |
sa sarvakāryāṇyutsṛjya tatraiva paridhāvati ||

jñānāmṛtena tṛptasya kṛtakṛtyasya yoginaḥ |
naivāsti kiñcit karttavyamasti cenna ca tatvavit ||

lokatrayepi kartavyaṃ kiṃcittasya na vidyate |
dehapāte tathā cātmā bhāti sarvatra sarvadā ||

tathā mataṅge (-)

jñānābhi vyaktaye vyaktiṃ vyaktaṃ tatvamaṇuṃ prati |

niśvāse (-)

aprameya guṇopetassarvajñaḥ khalu sarvadā |
sarvakṛtsarvaloke śaśśivatulyaḥ prajāyate ||

vyaktesau śivavatbhāti śiva eva tanukṣaye |

śivadharmmottare (-)

<p. 1091>

sarvajñaḥ paripūrṇaśca śuddhassarvataḥ prabhuḥ |
saṃsāra sāgarānmuktaśśivatulyaḥ prajāyate ||

tatraiva |

pralayānte tanuntyaktvā svātmanyevāvatiṣṭhate |

sarvajñānottare (-)

dharmmādharmma phalannāsti lokācāraṃ viśeṣataḥ |
niyamopi na tasyāsti nopavāsa vratāni ca ||

saṅkalpaṃ ca vikalpaṃ ca ye cānye kuladharmmakāḥ |
yadā bhedanna vidyante bālakonmattakādibhiḥ ||

etairnnāsti parāmuktiścidrūpaṃ vyāpakaṃ vinā |

mataṅge (-)

līlayaiva sa muktātmā vicaran kena vāryate |

sarvajñānottare (-)

digdeśa jātisambandhānvarṇāśrama samanvitān |
gacchaṃstiṣṭhan svapan jāgran bhuñjānanmaithunannapi ||

sarvadā sarvakāryeṣu vātaśītātapeṣu ca |
bhaya dāridryarogeṣu māndya vijvarakādiṣu ||

bhāvānetānparityajya cābhāvaṃ bhāvayet budhaḥ |

niśvāse (-)

<p. 1092>

yathā vāyussuśīghropi muktvākāśanna gacchati |
jñeya nikṣipta cittastu viṣayastho na muñcati ||

sarvajñānottare (-)

yomāṃ sarvagataṃ paśyet sarvaṃ ca mayi saṃsthitam |
tasyāhannityamātmasthassa ca nityaṃ mayi sthitaḥ ||

sadgurorupadeśena svaprakāśena niścayaḥ |

cintyaviśve (-)

jāgrādi pañcāvasthāyāmatīte jñānarūpakam |
satgurorupadeśena vijñānena na saṃśayaḥ ||

evaṃ jñātvā viśeṣeṇa samādhiṃ kārayet budhaḥ |
cittaṃ buddhisthitaṃ kṛtvā śivalakṣaṇameva hi ||

ānandaṃ śivabhogantu śivayogaṃ sadābhyaset |

sarvajñānottare (-)

yasya jāgradavasthāyānniyamānsakalendriyān |
turyāvasthā guṇopetaḥ kṣārabhāvanna gacchati ||

śabdādi viṣayānbhogī tadvat jñānī na lipyate |
cittaṃ śodhayayatnena kimanyairddehaśodhanaiḥ ||

suprabhede (-)

samastasukhaduḥkhābhyāntatpriyā priyayossamam |

<p. 1093>

śarīrātprāgvastutopi bhujyate svayameva tu |
sārdhadviśatikāyāmānanda lakṣaṇamuktam ||

rūpañca varṇarūpañca ānandaṃ trividhaṃ smṛtam |
rūpaṃ bahuvidha dhyānaṃ varṇarūpaṃ ca kalpanam ||

rūpārūpanna cā (**) m kalpanārahitaṃ matam |
śāśvatanturyarahitaṃ ānandaṃ paramaṃ padam ||

etasyaiva tu saṃprāptau muktireva na saṃśayaḥ |
guruvaktreṇa satsiddhirānandantu na saṃśayaḥ ||

evaṃ jñātvā viśeṣeṇa samādhiṃ kārayet budhaḥ |

suprabhede (-)

