niśvāse (-)

sarvajñādi guṇādeva gīyante sarvataśśive |

siddhānta rahasye (-)

svānya prakāśa citjñaptissaccidānandalakṣaṇaḥ |
śivasya ye guṇāsteṣāṃ samastāssanti te guṇāḥ ||

parameśārkakiraṇa prakāśīkṛta cakṣuṣaḥ |
na jānātyakṣivān śambhurjānāti śivacakṣuṣā ||

kṣīre kṣīramivābhinnaṃ vibhinnaṃ dṛṣṭi dṛṣṭavat |
śivātmanossāmarasyaṃ vyajyate guṇasāmyataḥ ||

jñānaṃ labdhvā parāṃ śāntimacireṇādhi gacchati |
tadā tu sarvaduḥkhānāṃ hānirasyopajāyate ||

sarvajñānottare (-)

<p. 1095>

yāvannotpadyate jñānaṃ tāvadbhramati karmmaṇā |
ajñānāvṛtadehastu duḥkhaśokapariplutaḥ ||

[aṣṭamasūtraṃ sampūrṇam] ||

[navamasūtram] ||

śivajñānabodhe |

cidṛśātmani dṛṣṭvaiśantyaktvā vṛttimarīcikām |
labdhvā śivapadacchāyāndhyāyet pañcākṣarīṃ sudhīḥ ||

svāyambhuve (-)

pāśajñānanna mukti syāt paśujñānantathaiva ca |
sarvataśca yatomuktiḥ paśujñānena gamyate ||

jagatastatva sambodhādajñānaṃ vinivarttate |
mokṣaṃ pañcākṣaraṃ vidyādabhivṛddhi ṣaḍakṣaram ||

śāstrajālāni nādāntaṃ pāśajñānaṃ varānane |
paśujñānamiti proktamupadeśa kramādyataḥ ||

tathā niśvāse (-)

vedaṃ sāṃkhyaṃ bauddhamārhamaparaṃ paramantathā |
yāni kāni ca śāstrāṇi sarve bindorviniḥsṛtāḥ ||

<p. 1096>

antargatāṇḍa jātasyāt muktaścet karaṇakṣayāt |
yathā tato vicāreṇa jñānātīto hi vidyate ||

malakṣayatayā proktantadā sāyujyamucyate |

kāraṇe (-)

sarvataścātmanā vedaṃ jñānenaiva hi gamyate |

tatraiva mantroddhāre (-)

vācyavācaka rahito vāṅmanotītagocaraḥ |
sarvajñādi guṇopetassarvatatvalayaḥ prabhuḥ ||

ākāśamiva tattvāni sarvavyāpī nirañjanaḥ |
ākāśa bhāvanantyaktvā śivabhāvena bhāvayet ||

vāyavya saṃhitāyām (-)

sa paśyati śarīranta taccharīranna paśyati |
tau paśyasti paraḥ kaścittāvubhau tanna paśyati ||

kālottare (-)

śivopakāratāṃ paśyettadā paśyeta nirgatam |

śivadharmmottare (-)

aṇimādi guṇaiśvaryaṃ sarvajñatvaṃ ca yoginaḥ |
tṛṇavadyastyajet sarvānīśastasya prasīdati ||

<p. 1097>

tataḥ prasanne deveśe buddhissatvātpravarttate |
aṇimādiguṇairyuktassantiṣṭhecchivavatprabhuḥ ||

sarvajñānottare (-)

aṇimādiguṇāvāptirjjāyatāṃ vā na jāyatām |
tathāpi mucyate dehī patiṃ vijñāya nirmmalam ||

sarvopādhivinirmmuktacidrūpaṃ yannirantaram |
tacchivohamiti jñātvā sarvāvasthāṃ vivarjjayet ||

tathā vātule (-)

tilānāntu yathā tailaṃ puṣpādgandhassamāśritaḥ |
puruṣasya śarīresmin sa bāhyābhyantare sthitaḥ ||

sarvajñānottare (-)

yaśśivassohameveti advaitaṃ bhāvayetsadā |
sarvapāpa vinimmuktirgurudhyānādaghakṣayaḥ ||

śivānanda paradhyānāt sa yāti paramāṃ gatim |
tatvamasmīti vedānte tatākhyātamiti kramam ||

siddhānta sambodhikāyām (-)

śiva bhāvena saṃyojya śivohaṃ smṛti nirṇayaḥ |
śivohamiti siddhāntaṃ vedānte sohamasmi tu ||

<p. 1098>

cintye (-)

tirodhaṃ malamityuktamātmā śakti śivātmakam |
pañcākṣaramidaṃ devi rahasyanna prakāśakam ||

aṅguṣṭhādi kaniṣṭhānta talayoścāṅgaṣaṭkakam |
vinyasya mūlamantreṇa vyāpakaṃ ca samācaret ||

raurave (-)

mantraśuddhau varttate |

anyūnādhika varṇantu sarvamantrān samuccaret |
ūnavarṇena mṛtyusyādadhike śokarogakṛt ||

svarahīne vipatti syāttānmantreṇa viśodhayet |

karaṇe (-)

hṛdaye yajanaṃ proktaṃ nābhau homaṃ prakalpayet |
tatheśantu bhruvormmadhye dhyāyetsarvagataṃ prabhum ||

suprabhede (-)

kuṇḍavyākhyā mahānāḍī nābhyadhastātprakīrtitā |
aṣṭavarttulamevantu kuṇḍalī suptanāgavat ||

nābherūrdhvaṃ bhavetpadmaṃ taṭākāntābjavatsmṛtam |
tasya madhye sthito devassūryakoṭi samaprabhaḥ ||

cintye (-)

arkasya sannidhau tatra rāhudarśanavat bhavet |

<p. 1099>

pañcākṣaraṃ vijānīyāddarśanaṃ śivamātmani |

kāmike (-)

yadvā vistarataḥ kuryānmānasaṃ yāgamādarāt |
śivādyavani paryanta tatvavrātātmakaṃ svakam ||

suprabhede (-)

pārthivāṇḍamayaṃ karddamāpyāntannālameva ca |
pradhāna tatvaparyantannāla kaṅkaṇakānvitam ||

niśvāse (-)

kadalīpuṣpa saṅkāśaṃ hṛdayaṃ sarvadehinām |
aṣṭāṅgula pramāṇantu nābherūrdhvaṃ vyavasthitam ||

padmanālannavadvāraṃ samantātkaṇṭakānvitam |
tasya madhye sthitaṃ padmamaṣṭapatraṃ sakarṇikam ||

vitasti mātraṃ hṛdayaṃ kamalaṃ caturaṅgulam |

kālottare (-)

pañcāśatparamaṃ bījañjagadyoniṃ parāparam |
aṅguṣṭha parvatulyantu karṇikākesarairyutam ||

bhīmasaṃhitāyām (-)

ādyanteṣu daleṣṣaṣṭau oṃ śivāya namonamaḥ |
indrādīśānaparyantannyasedaṣṭākṣaraṃ kramāt ||

<p. 1100>

niśvāse tatraiva |

karṇikāyāṃ sthito viṣṇurgranthirmmāyā prakīrtitā |
karṇikāyāṃ bhavetsūryastasya madhye tu candramāḥ ||

tasya madhye bhavedvahnirvahnimadhye maheśvaraḥ |

kiraṇe (-)

mantrātmikā kalā tasya te ca mantrāśśivātmakāḥ |
taiḥ prakalpya śarīrantu śuddhāṃdhvādhyāsitaṃ mahat ||

niśvāse (-)

sadāśivo maheśasya tasyāpi parataśśivaḥ |

tatraiva |

sadāśivaṃ mahātmānantasya cordhvaṃ parātparam ||

śītāṃśunirmmalaṃ divyaṃmagrāhyaṃ paramaṃ śivam |

śivadharmmottare (-)

jñānayoga pradhānatvādantaraṅgo vimuktidaḥ |
jñāne naiva tadajñānannirvarteta na karmmabhiḥ ||

suprabhede (-)

antaryāgasamāyukta ātmāśuddhaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |

vātule (-)

ahiṃsā prathamaṃ puṣpaṃ puṣpamindriya nigrahaḥ |
kṣāntiḥ puṣpandayā puṣpaṃ jñānapuṣpamataḥ param ||

<p. 1101>

tapassatyaṃ ca bhāvaśca puṣpamaṣṭavidhaṃ smṛtam |
etānyatrāṣṭa puṣpāṇi buddhidharmmasvarūpataḥ ||

mohaśūrottare (-)

agniḥ prāṇo manaḥpātraṃ gurudhūpaśikhākulaḥ |

ityādi pūjāstave uktaḥ | tathā hi (-)

liṅgaṃ tacca sudhāmayena payasā saṃsnāpya samyakpuna(-)
rvairāgyeṇa ca candanena vasubhiḥ puṣpairahiṃsādibhiḥ |
prāṇāyāmabhavena dhūpavidhinā ciddīpadānena yaḥ
pratyāhāramayena somahaviṣā sauṣumna jāpena ca ||

taccitto bahudhāraṇābhiramala dhyānodbhavairbhūṣaṇai(-)
statsāmyāṇu nivedanena yajate dhanyassa evāmataḥ |

suprabhede (-)

āsanādīni sarvāṇi tathaivā varaṇāni ca |
hṛtpadmo kalpayedvidvānyathoktantu yathā kramam ||

gandhādyairūpacāraistu manasākalpya pūjayet |

ṣaṭsahasrikāyām (-)

manasāsyārcanaṃ proktaṃ brahmādīnāmagocaram |
akṛtrima pradhānantu tenārntyāgamācaret ||

śivadharmmottare (-)

<p. 1102>

martyamāṇo yathā nityandarpaṇo nirmmalo bhavet |
jñānābhyāsāttathā puṃsāṃ buddhirbhavati nirmmalā ||

devikālottare (-)

svayaṃ patita puṣpaiśca kartavyaṃ yadi pūjanam |

śivatantrarahasya sāre (-)

bhāvasthirataro na syādyadā bāhye śivārcanam |
yathā dhyānānurūpanta dhyāna (********************) ||

