<p. 1105>

śivajñānabodha saṅgrahe (-)

malannedamiti jñātvā śivasya paramātmanaḥ |
yaśśaktiriti jānāti tataśśuddhyabhidhīyate ||

sarvajñānottare (-)

ātmanyeva sthitaśśānta ātmatṛptastu niścalaḥ |
nāgatohaṃ gatovāpi nāgamiṣye na gacchatā ||

na bhūto na bhaviṣyāmi prakṛtye sthira dharmmiṇi |
prākṛtāni tu karmmāṇi prakṛteḥ karmmasambhavaḥ ||

nāhaṃ kiṃcitkaromīti yukto manyeta tattvavit |
naiva prakṛti vandhosti mukta ityabhidhīyate ||

bhartṛhariḥ (-)

mīna snānaparaḥ phaṇīpavana bhuṅmeṣastu parṇāśano
nīrāśī khalu cātakaḥ pratidinaṃ śete bile mūṣikaḥ |
bhasmoddhūlana tatparaḥ khalukharo dhyānānurakto bako
nindaiṣāmabhavat phalaṃ kimadhunā jñāna pradhānantapaḥ ||

na tatra vedaśāstrāṇi yajñāśca bahudakṣiṇāḥ |
ātmavit jñānamāśritya vimalaṃ sarvatomukham ||

parasaṃvitsvarūpāyāśśakterasati bandhane |
paramātraṃ prakāśeta muktāṇūnāmanādaram ||

<p. 1104>

kālottare (-)

svakṛtānyupatiṣṭhanti duḥkhāni ca sukhāni ca |
hetu bhūto yatasteṣāṃ sohaṃkāreṇa bādhyate ||

kiraṇe (-)

heturllakṣaṇamityuktaṃ muktilakṣaṇamucyate |
mārjjārabhakṣite duḥkhaṃ yādṛśaṃ gṛhakukkuṭe ||

na tādṛṅmamatāśūnye kalapiṅgethamūṣike |

śivadharmmottare (-)

yathā vahnirmmahā dīptaśśuṣkamātrantu nirddahet |
tathāśubhāṃ śubhaṃ karmma jñānāgnirddahati kṣaṇāt ||

mataṅge (-)

yo bhilāṣātmako bhāvo mamatvenātmavarttinā |
soṃkuroṇoravidyākhya saṃsārotpattikāraṇam ||

śivadharmmottare (-)

tasmātsa paṇḍitaśśaktastapasvī vijitendriyaḥ |
yaśśivajñāna sadbhāvamālocayitumudyataḥ ||

krīḍanna lipyate nītastadvadindriya pannagaiḥ |
padmapatraṃ yathā toyaistatsthairapi na lipyate ||

tatvādi viṣayān bhogī tattvajñānī na lipyate |

<p. 1105>

śivajñānabodha saṅgrahe (-)

malannedamiti jñātvā śivasya paramātmanaḥ |
yaśśaktiriti jānāti tataśśuddhyabhidhīyate ||

sarvajñānottare (-)

ātmanyeva sthitaśśānta ātmatṛptastu niścalaḥ |
nāgatohaṃ gatovāpi nāgamiṣye na gacchatā ||

na bhūto na bhaviṣyāmi  prakṛtye sthiradharmmiṇi |
prākṛtāni tu karmmāṇi prakṛteḥ karmmasambhavaḥ ||

nāhaṃ kiṃcitkaromīti yukto manyeta tattvavit |
naiva prakṛti vandhosti mukta ityabhidhīyate ||

bhartṛhariḥ (-)

mīnasnānaparaḥ phaṇīpavana bhuṅmeṣastu parṇāśano
nīrāśīkhalu cātakaḥ pratidīnaṃ śete bile mūṣikaḥ |
bhasmoddhūlanatatparaḥ khalukharo dhyānānurakto bako
nindaiṣāmabhavat phalaṃ kīmadhunā jñāna pradhānantapaḥ ||

na tatra vedaśāstrāṇi yajñāśca bahudakṣiṇāḥ |
ātmavit jñānamāśritya vimalaṃ sarvatomukham ||

parasaṃvit svarūpāyāśśakterasati bandhane |
paramātraṃ prakāśeta muktāṇūnāmanādaram ||

<p. 1107>

malamāyādyasaṃspṛṣṭau bhavati svānubhūtimān |

suprabhede (-)

malamuktastathātmānaṃ śuddha ityucyate budhaiḥ |
īśvara smṛti nā kāle maledhvaṃsati nirmmalaḥ ||

atohamīśvaraṃ smṛtvā paścāttanmayatāṃ gataḥ |

sarvajñānottare (-)

avijñātaḥ paśussohi sṛṣṭidharmma samāśritaḥ |
vijñātaśśāśvatassiddhassaśivo nātra saṃśayaḥ ||

yogaje (-)

guhyātguhyatamaṃ guhyaṃ svānubhūtyanugamyate |

tathā sūtasaṃhitāyām (-)

evañjīvātmakaṃ rūpaṃ śivaṃ paśyati ceddṛḍham |
svātmanyeva ratikrīḍāṃ śuddhātmā kurute sadā ||

yatra supto janonityaṃ prabuddhastatra saṅgamī |
prabuddhā yatra te vidvan suṣuptastatra keśavān ||

śivadharmmottare (-)

jñānaṃ vikalpabahulaṃ rāgādyaiḥ kaluṣīkṛtam |
śivaprakāśakaṃ jñānaṃ yogastatraikacittatā ||

<p. 1108>

sarvajñānottare (-)

parāpara vibhāgena sthūlasūkṣma vibhāgataḥ |
paraḥ paramanirvāṇaḥ parasṛṣṭivivarjitaḥ ||

sthūlaṃ śabdamayaḥ proktassūkṣmo dhyānaika saṃśrayaḥ |
ityevamātmano jñānaṃ kathitantu samāsataḥ ||

athavā bahunoktena kimetena ṣaḍānana |
vāgvikalpa viśeṣeṇa manassaṃmoha kāraṇā ||

sarvadharmmātmanassārameva te parikalpayet |

yogaje (-)

vācyavācaka rahito vāṅmanotīta gocaraḥ |
śivaśśuddha iti prokto rūpī avyaya īśvaraḥ ||

cintye (-)

jñātṛjñeyaṃ tathātmāna vihīnantatparaṃ padam |

suprabhede (-)

jñānaṃ pravartate vatsa bhrānti nirṇāśanāya ca |
adhvaśreṇi vināśāya śiva vyaktikarāya ca ||

andhakāravadajñānaṃ jñānandīpavaducyate |
jñeyaṃ bhāskaravatproktaṃ tasmātjñānaṃ viśiṣyate ||

mṛgendre (-)

<p. 1109>

nādhyakṣannāpi tallaiṅgaṃ na śābdamapi śāṅkaram |
jñānamābhāti vimalaṃ sarvadā sarvavastuṣu ||

cintye (-)

karmmakṣayānna yujyante dehināṃ deha sambhavāt |
dehaṃ vinā pṛthakkarma yujyate na kadācana ||

nityaṃ dvandva samāyuktā vetau cānyonyataḥ purā |
tathāpi karmmanāśaśca gātreṇa kurute punaḥ ||

tatraiva |

dehināṃ puṇya pāpābhyāṃ dehamārabhyate purā |
yathā jīrṇāni vastrāṇi tyaktvā vastrannavaṃ vaset ||

tathā dehaṃ parityaktvā dehāntaramavāpnuyāt |
evaṃ bhavābdhau majjantaṃ puṇyapāpasamāhitam ||

jñānabodhaṃ samārabhya tārayantyāśujantapaḥ |

cintya viśve (-)

tatrātmanāṃ malañcaiva bandhadharmmatva kāraṇam |
malānāṃ vāsanānāṃ ca nāśo mokṣo na saṃśayaḥ ||

suprabhede (-)

svabhāvajñānato muktassa jīvanmukta eva hi |
yaśśivaṃ mukta ityukto dehānte mukta ucyate ||

kiraṇe (-)

<p. 1110>

viṣasambandhinī śaktiryathā mantrairnirudhyate |
tathā na tadviṣaṃ kṣīṇamevaṃ puṃso malakṣayaḥ ||

phalaṃ kataka vṛkṣasya kṣiptaṃ sat kaluṣe jale |
kurute śaktisaṃrodhaṃ kiṃ kṣipatyanyato jalāt ||

śivajñānantathā tasya śaktisaṃrodhakārakam |

kiraṇe (-)

tato malakṣayenāpi puruṣasyakṣayaṃ bhavet |

uttaram |

sahajā kālimātāmre tatkṣayannava tatkṣayaḥ ||

tathā tāmrasya tadvat syāt evaṃ puṃso malakṣayaḥ |

suprabhede (-)

malairmuktastathātmānaṃ śuddha ityucyate dhruvam |

raurave (-)

yathā sūryodayaṃ prāpya tamaḥ kṣipraṃ vinaśyati ||

kiraṇe (-)

tuṣakambvaṅkurañcaiva puruṣasya malakṣayaḥ |
nityānādirākhyātastatkathaṃ syānmaheśvara ||

uttaram |

śuddhākṣatamya naivāsti śuddhātmasya tathaiva ca |
śuddhātmānna sthito teṣānnāsti nāśaḥ kadācana ||

tasminpunarapi |

<p. 1111>

carācarādi jantūnāṃ śivaiva prāṇa ucyate |
prasarantaṃ vinā nāsti akṣarāṇāmakāravat ||

śivadharmmottare (-)

sarvatrāvasthitaṃ śāntanna prapaśyati śaṅkaram |
jñānacakṣurvihīnatvādandhassūryamivoditam ||

mataṅge (-)

athārka raśmisaṃparśādyathā jñānakriyātmikā |

niśvāse (-)

sarvajñānottare (-)

tāmrasyaiva tu hematvamantarllīnaṃ yathā bhavet |
antarlīnaṃ tathā jñeyaṃ śivatvaṃ putgalasya tu ||

rasaviddhaṃ yathā tāmraṃ hematvaṃ pratipadyate |
tathā vijñāna sambandhācchivatvaṃ pratipadyate ||

rasendreṇaiva lohānāṃ kālimā sparśavedhinā |
hāritā cāgni saṃyogāddhematvaṃ pratipadyate ||

hāritaṃ parameśena paśūnāṃ pāśakālimā |
svakāraṇa guṇāveśā hematvaṃ pratipadyate ||

labhante yoginassarve vijñānāttulyatāntathā |

<p. 1112>

mṛgendre (-)

yepi tatpadamāpannāśaiva sādhanayogataḥ |
te tatsthitya mahāhlādaṃ prāpya yānti paraṃ padam ||

na ca sṛṣṭyādi kurvanti svārtha niṣṭhāhite yataḥ |

tathā sarvamatopanyāse (-)

avarjanīya saṃsiddhiṃ muktānāṃ kṛtyapañcakam |
kṛpayā tu śivasyeva svārtha niṣṭhā hi te yataḥ ||

na te viśvasya kartāraḥ kartāraśśiva eva hi  |

sarvajñānottare (-)

śivajñānāmṛtaṃ pītvā vicaransvayameva hi |
śivavacchāśvataśśuddhassṛṣṭidharma vivarjitaḥ ||

śivadharmmottare (-)

pralayānte tanuntyaktvā svātmanyevāvatiṣṭhate |

dvayośca citsvarūpopi jñātvā budhyā vibhinnayā |
tasmādekopapūjyopi na hyetīya kathyate ||

mṛgendre (-)

dṛkkriyātmakamaiśvaryaṃ yasya taddātṛpūrvakam |
īśvarastatra mantavyaśśaktidvayayutaḥ prabhuḥ ||

<p. 1113>

kiraṇe (-)

tadātma śivayossandhirayaskānteva yujyate |

vātule (-)

puruṣañca śivañcaiva līyate sāyasāgnivat |
yathā tāmraṃ rasaṃ vidhyeddoṣamuktaṃ purātanam ||

tathātmānaṃ śivelīnaṃ jalena lavaṇenavat |
aviśeṣaṃ bhavet tadvadātmānu paramātmani ||

evaṃ śivāmṛtaṃ proktaṃmaprakāśyamidaṃ guha |

[ityekādaśasūtram sampūrṇam] ||


[dvādaśasūtram] ||

śivajñānabodhe (-)

muktiṃ prāpya tatasteṣāṃ bhajedveṣaṃ śivālayam |

tathā mataṅge (-)

śāsanasyāpi ye bhaktāstepi duḥkhavivarjitāḥ |
apasarobhirvṛtā nityaṃ krīḍantyutkṛṣṭacetasaḥ ||

liṅgaṃ maheśvaraṃ bhaktyā namaskārādināthavā |
pūjayanti narāśśūrāstepi siddhā gaṇeśvarāḥ ||

ramanti vividhairbhogaiḥ prāpya sthānamumāpateḥ |

<p. 1114>

ālaye śivaliṅgasya bhaktyā nirvartate śubhe |
śrīkaṇṭhapadamāruhya sukhamatyadbhutaṃ labhet ||

evaṃ bhaktivibhāgena liṅge vā pitarastathā |
upāsanti mahādevantepi siddhā narottamāḥ ||

mataṅge (-)

śivavacchivabhaktāstu draṣṭavyāśśivakāṃkṣibhiḥ |
saṃskṛtāśca śivairmantrairguruṇā śivamūrtinā ||

sarve samānadharmmāṇastathāpyeṣocyate vidhiḥ |
gurorapyagratasteṣāṃ jyeṣṭhānāmeva māsanam ||

yathānukrama śuśrūṣāvandanādīni cakratuḥ |
kāryāṇyanyonya saṃmhṛ(?)ṣṭairgamācakṣurviṣaye guroḥ ||

cintya viśve (-)

janmāntara tapobhiśca sanmārgajñānasambhavaḥ |

mataṅge (-)

puryaṣṭaka samāyogāt puṃsāṃ karmānusāraḥ |

kāmike (-)

śivaṃ vai śāśvatannityaṃ jñānānandamayātmakam |
vyāpakaṃ sarvatatvānāmaprameyamanupamam ||

vācyavācakarahitaṃ vāṅmanotītagocaram |

<p. 1115>

vyaktiṃ kuryādviśeṣeṇa śivakalasakalātmani ||

śivapurāṇe (-)

brahmayatsaccidānandaṃ paripūrṇaṃ ca sarvadā |
sarvatra dṛśyate naiva karaṇā gocaratvataḥ ||

kālottare (-)

prākṛtaṃ bhāvamutsṛjya śivohamiti bhāvayet |

niśvāse (-)

śivodeśikadeśasthaḥ prāṇyanugrahakārakaḥ |
dadāti vividhāṃ siddhiṃ mokṣaṃ ca nayate paśum ||

svadehānnirviśeṣeṇa śivabhaktāṃśca pālayet |

aṃśumati (-)

dehaṃ prāsādamityuktaṃ dehī liṅgamiti smṛtam |
ubhayorantarannāsti tasmāditthaṃ prabhāvayet ||

athavānya prakāreṇa sthūlaliṅge sadāśivam |
antarlliṅge śivaṃ jñeyaṃ bhāvayeddeśikottamaḥ ||

vyāpyavyāpaka bhāvena liṅgamevaṃ vimānakam |
mūlādisthūpi paryantaṃ śivarūpamiti smṛtam ||

malamāyādi sarveṣu gateṣu para īśvaraḥ |
sarvāṅgeṣu teṣu bhagavānnahi deheṣu pūjyate ||

<p. 1116>

liṅgethavā nyatraśubhe sampūjyo bhagavāñcchivaḥ |
āvāhanamanudhyānaṃ manebhukti nirodhanam ||

śivena saha saṃyogaṃ cintayenmanasādhiyā |

tathā parākhye (-)

pūjyate parataśśāntassiddhimukti phalārthibhiḥ |
sa eva mantradehasthaḥ pūjyatesau paraśśivaḥ ||

gavāṃ sarvāṅgataḥ kṣīraṃ sravate na mukhādyayau |
evaṃ liṅgamayaṃ rūpaṃ sarvakāmeṣu rohati ||

jñānayogam |

kiraṇe (-)

ye yathā saṃsthitāstārkṣya tathaiveśa prasādakṛt |
keciccātra kriyāyogyāsteṣāṃ muktistathaiva hi ||

jñānayogyāstathaivānye caryāyogyāstathāpare |
evameṣāṃ ca yadyuktaṃ mokṣante naia yojayet ||

mataṅge (-)

sadāśive pade yogāccaryāto vātha dīkṣayā |
prāpyate cittabhedena mokṣo vātha catuṣṭayāt ||

tathā vāyavye (-)

jñānaṃ kriyā ca caryā ca yogañceti sureśvari |
catuṣpādāssamākhyātā dharmmādharmmāssanātanāḥ ||

<p. 1117>

paśupāśapatijñānaṃ jñānamityabhidhīyate |
ṣaḍadhvaśuddhividhinā gurvadhīnā kriyocyate ||

varṇāśrama prayuktasya mayaiva vihitasya ca |
madarccanādi dharmmasya caryācaryeti kathyate ||

madyukte naiva mārgeṇa mayyavasthā pracetasaḥ |
pratyantare tirodhena sa yoga iti gīyate ||

skandakālottare (-)

īśvaraḥ ||

labhyate śāsvataṃ jñānaṃ tatprasādena ṣaṇmukham |
yamanniyamamāsīnaṃ prāṇāyāmantataḥ param ||

pratyāhāro dhāraṇā ca samādhidhyānataḥ param |
guruprasādāllabhate divyayogaṃ ṣaḍānana ||

ākāśagamanaṃ caiva parakāya praveśanam |
manojayatvaṃ hi janā tatprasādena labhyate ||

aṇimā laghimā caiva mahimā garimā tathā |
prāptiḥ prākāmyamīśatvaṃ vaśitvaṃ cāṣṭa siddhayaḥ ||

guruprasādāllabhate mukto mṛtyujarādibhiḥ |

viśvasāre (-)

guru rūpaṃ paraṃ brahma gururūpaṃ paraṃ śivam |
guru rūpaṃ paraṃ jñānaṃ guru rūpaṃ parātparam ||

tasmātsarvaprayatnena guru rūpaṃ sadā smaret |

<p. 1118>

tathā |

īkṣaṇadhyāna saṃsparśairmatsya kūrmma vihaṅgamāḥ |
poṣayanti svakānputrān tadvatpaṇḍita vṛttayaḥ ||

niśvāse (-)

prakāśayasvedaṃ jñānaṃ madbhaktānāṃ varānane |
rakṣaṇīyaṃ prayatnena taskarebhyo dhanaṃ yathā ||

devikālottare (-)

īdṛśaṃ jñānasadbhāvaṃ na dadyādyasya kasyacit |
dīkṣayitvā mahādevi dātavyaṃ suparīkṣya ca ||

nāśiṣyāya pradātavyannā putrāya kadācana |
gurudevāgni bhaktāya mātsaryarahitāya ca ||

pradātavyamidaṃ jñānamitareṣānna dāpayet |

[dvādaśatamasūtraṃ sampūrṇam] ||

[iti śrīmadvyāghrapuravāsanigamajñāna śivayogīśiṣyavedajñāna śivācārya saṅgrahasakalāgamasārabhūta śivajñānasiddherdṛṣṭāntassamāptaḥ] ||

|| oṃ śrīmadaruṇācalāya namaḥ ||

